ollowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/clement-scality","id":294465750,"login":"clement-scality","node_id":"U_kgDOEY0w1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clement-scality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/634d7e5901af6a291330fb2d5eb635efa50db905/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:45:05Z","email":"clement.dorosario@scality.com","name":"Clément Do Rosario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:45:05Z","email":"clement.dorosario@scality.com","name":"Clément Do Rosario"},"message":"improvement(charts): say ''the digits before the e'' rather than ''mantissa''\n\nReview feedback: the word is jargon, and in floating point it is also a misnomer --\nIEEE-754 calls it the significand, and a mantissa is the fractional part of a\nlogarithm. Naming the thing by where it sits costs nothing and asks nothing of the\nreader.\n\nDEFAULT_MANTISSA_DIGITS becomes SCIENTIFIC_NOTATION_DECIMALS, which also pairs it with\nthe threshold it sits beside. The formatISONumber docstring goes with it, being the one\nline that documents the dual meaning this change is about; the remaining uses describe\nfloat-noise bounding instead and are left alone.","tree":{"sha":"790c43b7da8c6f769f7549d263fb1b778bbfd14b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/c