om/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/23bd5cfa8b8c84cd8131c7946acbeb19b332f04c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:25:34Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:25:34Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"docs(color): state the rule as what to do, not what to avoid\n\nThe opening said never use a custom colour, which argued with the section right\nbelow it on how to use one. It also passed only the color prop, reading as if\nthat were the single route to a token.\n\nIt now says every colour comes from the palette, and the example carries three\ncolour props with the styled-component snippet colouring a border too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fae88f902203657d56456bb8ddb739e7fd48d24f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/trees/fae88f902203657d56456bb8ddb739e7fd48d24f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/commits/23bd5cfa8b8c84cd8131c7946acbeb19b332f04c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/23bd5cfa8b8c84cd8131c7946acbeb19b332f04c","node_id":"C_kwDOClq30NoAKDIzYmQ1Y2ZhOGI4Yzg0Y2Q4MTMxYzc5NDZhY2JlYjE5YjMzMmYwNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/8481c9c623c5e7d27e9183c1f2a2600a064e0b66","sha":"8481c9c623c5e7d27e9183c1f2a2600a064e0b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/8481c9c623c5e7d27e9183c1f2a2600a064e0b66"}],"sha":"23bd5cfa8b8c84cd8131c7946acbeb19b332f04c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/23bd5cfa8b8c84cd8131c7946acbeb19b332f04c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/8481c9c623c5e7d27e9183c1f2a2600a064e0b66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:25:29Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:25:29Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(CUI-59): name the colour type ThemeColor, one name for all of them\n\nBoxColor was the third name for the same union: ThemeColors in theme.ts (used by\nAppContainer and panels) and IconColor in Icon.component.tsx were already both\nkeyof CoreUITheme. Collapse them into ThemeColor, declared beside CoreUITheme and\nexported from index.ts and next.ts so a consumer wrapping Box can type the colour\nprop it passes through.\n\nThemeColors is gone rather than kept as an alias: a singular and a plural one\nletter apart, meaning different things, is a trap. Neither it nor IconColor was\npublicly exported, so nothing outside the repo moves; AppContainer''s background\nmerely gains transparent. Icon''s own prop still widens to string and converges\nseparately, since that one is a public change.\n\nThe theme.ts comments say the part the types do not: why the augmentation needs\nthe empty import, and why the scales live outside CoreUITheme. Stack''s color\ncomment now explains why the prop is redeclared at all.\n\nDrop the useTheme call and import left dead in AttachmentConfirmationModal when\nits one theme read became a token name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22689505512d6ef19509373454e6d5c6b7962b6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/trees/22689505512d6ef19509373454e