re. The guideline documented the\n\"+N\" trigger only under the dropped columns, so it read as specific to columns\nhidden by a breakpoint.\n\nAdds a Hidden values section stating the general rule, and one sentence in Row\nselection saying that a table with no onRowSelected has no hover state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62bd19b5badcbfe0f99fef8701d0ad2e882c510c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/trees/62bd19b5badcbfe0f99fef8701d0ad2e882c510c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/commits/d1173a3e37171c449927851d1086303855baad05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28654802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Cuervino","id":28654802,"login":"Cuervino","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjU0ODAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/d1173a3e37171c449927851d1086303855baad05","node_id":"C_kwDOClq30NoAKGQxMTczYTNlMzcxNzFjNDQ5OTI3ODUxZDEwODYzMDM4NTViYWFkMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/2584c23581aa2680b0d516c1332f5ae704708ddc","sha":"2584c23581aa2680b0d516c1332f5ae704708ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/2584c23581aa2680b0d516c1332f5ae704708ddc"}],"sha":"d1173a3e37171c449927851d1086303855baad05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/d1173a3e37171c449927851d1086303855baad05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28654802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Cuervino","id":28654802,"login":"Cuervino","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjU0ODAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/322c2427ac3f3572b19527ab34687785ef25a214/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:47:54Z","email":"valamir.miezelis@scality.com","name":"Cuervino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:47:54Z","email":"valamir.miezelis@scality.com","name":"Cuervino"},"message":"improvement(layout): a guideline for the page patterns\n\nTemplates/Layout had nine stories and no guideline, so nothing stated what\ngoes in each AppContainer slot, for which type of page, or when the overall\nsummary applies. Two stories labelled it \"optional\", which left the decision\nto whoever built the screen.\n\nThe rules come from an inventory of the twelve ARTESCA listing pages. They\ncover the two resource listing forms, full page and list-detail, what\nbrowsability governs, dashboards without a canonical composition, and forms\nas not yet defined.\n\nA ResourceListPage story composes the pattern with a real Table, so it can be\ncopied rather than only read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3081c1bc52e248edf993fc546608e8957e89116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/trees/a3081c1bc52e248edf993fc546608e8957e89116"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/commits/322c2427ac3f3572b19527ab34687785ef25a214","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28654802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Cuervino","id":28654802,"login":"Cuervino","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjU0ODAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuervino","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/322c2427ac3f3572b19527ab34687785ef25a214","node_id":"C_kwDOClq30NoAKDMyMmMyNDI3YWMzZjM1NzJiMTk1MjdhYjM0Njg3Nzg1ZWYyNWEyMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/2584c23581aa2680b0d516c1332f5ae704708ddc","sha":"2584c23581aa2680b0d516c1332f5ae704708ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/2584c23581aa2680b0d516c1332f5ae704708ddc"}],"sha":"322c2427ac3f3572b19527ab34687785ef25a214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/322c2427ac3f3572b19527ab34687785ef25a214"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/7a84f3289fb354d2b29904f64c7e552dc2ffdee9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:32:15Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:32:15Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"test(tooltip): stop pinning the sc-* class names\n\nThe point of the change is to give tests a role to query instead of a\nprivate class, so a test asserting those classes are present works\nagainst it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"894f7fde50663b0973d54c8612e753116e1ec4f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/trees/894f7fde50663b0973d54c8612e753116e1ec4f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/commits/7a84f3289fb354d2b29904f64c7e552dc2ffdee9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/7a84f3289fb354d2b29904f64c7e552dc2ffdee9","node_id":"C_kwDOClq30NoAKDdhODRmMzI4OWZiMzU0ZDJiMjk5MDRmNjRjN2U1NTJkYzJmZmRlZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/core-ui/commit/03f984ac6baac5da74a1d7c66b22b3182b566435","sha":"03f984ac6baac5da74a1d7c66b22b3182b566435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/03f984ac6baac5da74a1d7c66b22b3182b566435"}],"sha":"7a84f3289fb354d2b29904f64c7e552dc2ffdee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/7a84f3289fb354d2b29904f64c7e552dc2ffdee9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/commits/03f984ac6baac5da74a1d7c66b22b3182b566435/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:23:03Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:23:03Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(tooltip): give the overlay a tooltip role and point the trigger at it\n\nThe overlay rendered with no role, no id and nothing tying it to its trigger, so\na screen reader never announced it and the only handle a test had was the\nprivate `sc-tooltip` class.\n\nAdd `role=\"tooltip\"` and a `useId` id on the overlay, and `aria-describedby` on\nthe trigger while it is shown. Both are driven by the same condition that\nrenders the overlay, so the reference cannot point at an absent id.\n\nThe description is announced only where the trigger is focusable, which is 2 of\nthe 7 internal call sites. Making the rest focusable changes the tab order\neverywhere the component is used and is left for its own change.\n\nAdds the component''s first test file, and moves the ConstrainedText tooltip\ntests off the private class onto the role — they now assert the full text is in\nthe tooltip rather than that a wrapper element exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86d541eadd1ad0605ce462dd2b870e1436431fed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/trees/86d541eadd1ad0605ce462dd2b870e1436431fed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/core-ui/git/commits/03f984ac6baac5da74a1d7c66b22b3182b566435","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"