GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/1f1d5720702db7ccf4615d7c09db8152249f2693/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T16:26:30Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T16:26:30Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Keep the call monitor retrying when the box refuses the connection (#622)\n\nSince 5.0.0 a refused connection on port 1012 (ECONNREFUSED) stopped\nthe call monitor until the adapter was restarted. A FRITZ!Box which\nrestarts, e.g. after a firmware update, refuses the port for a while,\nso the call monitor states stayed dead with the instance still green.\n4.x kept retrying only because it checked err.errno, which is a number.\n\n- a refusal retries every 60 s instead of stopping the call monitor\n- the #96*5* hint is logged once and only if the call monitor was never\n  connected; a refusal after a connection is logged as info\n- no second \"Cannot start callmonitor\" error for a refusal\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03ae2bc0aaa778e4595029e930e950c78bf13f6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/03ae2bc0aaa778e4595029e930e950c78bf13f6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/commits/1f1d5720702db7ccf4615d7c09db8152249f2693","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/1f1d5720702db7ccf4615d7c09db8152249f2693","node_id":"C_kwDOCmpHGdoAKDFmMWQ1NzIwNzAyZGI3Y2NmNDYxNWQ3YzA5ZGI4MTUyMjQ5ZjI2OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416","sha":"5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416"}],"sha":"1f1d5720702db7ccf4615d7c09db8152249f2693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/1f1d5720702db7ccf4615d7c09db8152249f2693"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T16:11:44Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T16:11:44Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Keep sensitive data out of the debug log (#632)\n\nPhone numbers, names, call list and phone book content, host names, MAC\nand IP addresses, values of states and command results are logged only\nwith level silly; the debug log keeps a message without the data. The\nresult of states.command was even logged with level info and could\ncontain a WLAN passphrase.\n\n- redactUrl() replaces the session ID in URLs of the box, it is never\n  logged; the phone book URL is not logged at all\n- warnings and infos name a configured device by its name, not by its\n  MAC address\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3574a348a0351ab090f3b4d162db8212afac81c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/3574a348a0351ab090f3b4d162db8212afac81c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/commits/5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416","node_id":"C_kwDOCmpHGdoAKDVjZDQ0Y2RkZGIwYTdjODcwZDVlZmY4OGEzODVlYjBlOGU2Yjk0MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a","sha":"a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a"}],"sha":"5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/5cd44cdddb0a7c870d5eff88a385eb0e8e6b9416"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:59:09Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:59:09Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Do not hang when the box does not deliver a service description (#653)\n\ntr-O64 reads the description (SCPD) of every service and calls back\nonly when all of them arrived. For a description which the box does not\ndeliver (x_speedtestSCPD.xml of several FRITZ!OS 8.24 Labor versions)\nit neither calls back nor reports an error, so the adapter stayed green,\nlogged nothing and never updated a state.\n\n- guardServiceDescriptions() patches Device.prototype._addService with\n  a 10 s timeout: such a service becomes an empty one with\n  meta.unavailable and is logged as a warning\n- connect() limits init() to 60 s, a lost answer becomes a failed\n  connection attempt with retry\n- a missing DeviceConfig or WANIPConnection service no longer crashes\n  init()\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c706115fcd47d5f6429487a5ead82fa113176cdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/c706115fcd47d5f6429487a5ead82fa113176cdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/commits/a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a","node_id":"C_kwDOCmpHGdoAKGExOGQxYTJlMDM0NmQ1NjE1NjA3YjA0YmUxYzgwNmYzYzQyYWNkOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf","sha":"02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf"}],"sha":"a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/a18d1a2e0346d5615607b04be1c806f3c42acd8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:44:26Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T15:44:26Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Find configured devices by normalized MAC, do not stall on lost answers (#660)\n\njsonDeviceList only lists the configured devices, and it stayed empty\nwithout any error when the box did not find them: every SOAP fault\narrives as HTTP 500, so an unknown MAC address was treated like an\noffline device which was never seen and silently left out.\n\n- forEachConfiguredDevice() sends the MAC as AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF\n  (normalizeMac()), the configured spelling is kept everywhere else\n- a device which was never seen is logged once with a hint to check its\n  MAC address and listed as inactive in jsonDeviceList\n- every GetSpecificHostEntry has a 3 s timeout: one lost answer stopped\n  the presence detection and the poll cycle for good\n- info message if the JSON device list is switched on but no devices\n  are configured; a missing devices setting is treated as empty\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f122caca3927fdfec61b28b985bfacf0d834017e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/f122caca3927fdfec61b28b985bfacf0d834017e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/commits/02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf","node_id":"C_kwDOCmpHGdoAKDAyZjQ2MTNjNzE5MjM4YWJkN2ZmZTliY2EzMDQ0M2JiNTgyZTVkYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042","sha":"8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042"}],"sha":"02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/02f4613c719238abd7ffe9bca30443bb582e5dbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:49:17Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:49:17Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Detect a second 5 GHz band, add wlan52 states (#667)\n\nThe FRITZ!Box 4060 has 2.4 GHz and two 5 GHz bands plus the guest WLAN\n(WLANConfiguration:4). Since c7fd380 the guest WLAN is taken from the\nlast configuration, but the third band was always treated as 6 GHz and\ncreated as wlan60.\n\ninitWLANs() now reads NewX_AVM-DE_FrequencyBand of GetInfo of the third\nphysical access point: 6000 gives wlan60, everything else (5000, a\nfirmware without the argument, no answer) gives wlan52. init() calls\nback when the bands are known, because the WLAN states are created\nafterwards. New states wlan52 and wlan52Password; wlan switches the\nsecond 5 GHz band as well.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a22875c5f1e0382f4d5c020f9ba5290f36135f01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/a22875c5f1e0382f4d5c020f9ba5290f36135f01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/commits/8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042","node_id":"C_kwDOCmpHGdoAKDgxMjRmNWExYzJlZDdhZjE0NjY0Y2QzYmQ3MGU0MWFjNTZkYTUwNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commit/d1c424092d132648b73db3197aa0618428b1afe3","sha":"d1c424092d132648b73db3197aa0618428b1afe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/d1c424092d132648b73db3197aa0618428b1afe3"}],"sha":"8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/8124f5a1c2ed7af14664cd3bd70e41ac56da5042"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/d1c424092d132648b73db3197aa0618428b1afe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:37:06Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:37:06Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Keep call lists updated, add states.abNewMessages (#690)\n\nThe call lists were only refreshed on connect and when the call monitor\nreported a call. The call monitor socket had no TCP keepalive, so a\nconnection which the box dropped silently (e.g. by a restart) was never\nnoticed and the lists froze until the instance was restarted. Without\ncall monitor they were only read on start.\n\n- the call monitor socket uses TCP keepalive and reconnects\n- the call lists are also refreshed by the poll cycle, at most once a\n  minute\n- XML downloads moved to getXml()/parseXml() in utils.ts: 10 s timeout,\n  callback called exactly once, a failed call list download is logged\n- new state states.abNewMessages: number of not yet listened messages\n  of all answering machines shown in the web interface (New = 1)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87462580b8e11b8f41998d3abd5464100ff6b028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/87462580b8e11b8f41998d3abd5464100ff6b028"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/commits/d1c424092d132648b73db3197aa0618428b1afe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":