llowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/c7fd3801ef878abbf6381e1866ace0b05554d059/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:16:51Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:16:51Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Switch the guest WLAN on boxes with a 6 GHz band, add wlan60 (#726, #608)\n\nThe guest WLAN was hard-coded as WLANConfiguration:3, which is the 6 GHz\nWLAN on a FRITZ!Box 5690 Pro (guest = 4), so wlanGuest switched the\n6 GHz WLAN and the guest WLAN could not be switched at all.\n\ninitWLANs() now takes the last WLAN configuration of the box as guest\nWLAN and the ones in between as 5 GHz and 6 GHz. New states wlan60 and\nwlan60Password, created only if the box has a 6 GHz band; wlan also\nswitches 6 GHz.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7cc34f601c03e3743fc5511e97845a53d407ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/d7cc34f601c03e3743fc5511e97845a53d407ec3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064