:{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/commits/9c69e8cedfe4604b9ff5f0edea751bcdb7c390da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T21:06:31Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T21:06:31Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v5.0.1\n\n- (@GermanBluefox) **Breaking change:** the adapter requires node.js >= 22 now\n- (@GermanBluefox) Adapter requires admin >= 7.7.22 now\n- (@GermanBluefox) Adapter requires js-controller >= 6.0.11 now\n- (@GermanBluefox) The adapter does not stop any more if the Fritz!Box cannot be reached. The connection is retried every 30 seconds, and the new state `info.connection` shows whether the box answers\n- (@justr1) Expected disconnects of the call monitor (`ETIMEDOUT`, `ECONNRESET`, `EPIPE`) are logged as info now, because the adapter reconnects on its own\n- (@GermanBluefox) The mDNS socket is closed when the adapter stops, so a restart does not leave a listener behind\n- (@GermanBluefox) A phone book with only one contact is read now\n- (@GermanBluefox) The hint how to open port 1012 is shown again if the call monitor is refused by the Fritz!Box\n- (@GermanBluefox) The adapter was refactored to TypeScript. The sources are in `src/`, the adapter runs from `build/`\n- (@GermanBluefox) The configuration dialog was rewritten as JsonConfig. Admin 7.7.22 or newer is required for it\n- (@GermanBluefox) The adapter can only be installed from npm now, no longer directly from GitHub (`common.nogit`)\n- (@GermanBluefox) The options \"Use call forwarding options\", \"Use mDNS\" and \"Create JSON device list\" have a default value in `io-package.json` now\n- (@GermanBluefox) The command `dumpservices.fs` writes the file again instead of stopping the adapter","tree":{"sha":"3fd336b589102ed9de0ea5d892ad03cbfdeb27ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/trees/3fd336b589102ed9de0ea5d892ad03cbfdeb27ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.tr-064/git/commits/9c69e8cedfe4604b9ff5f0edea751bcdb7c390da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users