ass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#1164)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdbe2be713d26ee89c362d4aa94df3466c2b635d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/cdbe2be713d26ee89c362d4aa94df3466c2b635d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/91a08d728357bdd056db0448ecb77330e64adc69","verification":{"payload":"tree cdbe2be713d26ee89c362d4aa94df3466c2b635d\nparent c991b8d0205d7f2ca1a0753fc3d92a88ba9aef24\nauthor berfinyuksel <99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com> 1791395607 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791395607 +0200\n\nPass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#1164)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SI