ps://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/93ada70ae95b7c6165c990aa001e0af364e7e2b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:17:46Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:17:46Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"message":"Merge remote-tracking branch ''origin/2026.2'' into 2026.x\n\nBrings the packaged Studio frontend build (#1156) forward: the expanded\nsrc/Resources/public/studio/build tree is no longer committed, only\nbuild-dist/build-<id>.zip, which is extracted at cache warmup.\n\nConflict resolution:\n- doc/01_Installation_and_Upgrade/01_Upgrade_Notes.md: kept BOTH sections.\n  2026.x added \"Upgrade to 2026.3.0\" (GraphQL Renderlet) and 2026.2 added\n  \"Upgrade to 2026.2.8\" (packaged build); they are different releases, so\n  picking a side would have dropped one release''s notes. Ordering follows the\n  file''s newest-first convention: 2026.3.0, 2026.2.8, 2026.2.6.\n- src/Resources/public/studio/build/**: took 2026.2''s deletion; superseded by\n  the packaged archive. CI regenerates it.\n\nNo composer change needed: 2026.x already requires studio-ui-bundle ^2026.2.5,\nwhich provides the archive extraction.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"553fac4197627b91d5756c428b3eba6a5c2eec24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/553fac4197627b91d5756c428b3eba6a5c2eec24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/93ada70ae95b7c6165c990aa001e0af364e7e2b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/data-hub/commit/93ada70ae95b7c6165c990aa001e0af364e7e2b3","node_id":"C_kwDOCnS6t9oAKDkzYWRhNzBhZTk1YjdjNjE2NWM5OTBhYTAwMWUwYWYzNjRlN2UyYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/data-hub/commit/fde8e25acf9a2ebf7729811c4a368ec5ce536306","sha":"fde8e25acf9a2ebf7729811c4a368ec5ce536306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/fde8e25acf9a2ebf7729811c4a368ec5ce536306"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/data-hub/commit/af4c421feb6939a26f333595ac3ada925ff3adb3","sha":"af4c421feb6939a26f333595ac3ada925ff3adb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/af4c421feb6939a26f333595ac3ada925ff3adb3"}],"sha":"93ada70ae95b7c6165c990aa001e0af364e7e2b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/93ada70ae95b7c6165c990aa001e0af364e7e2b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/af4c421feb6939a26f333595ac3ada925ff3adb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:07:48Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:07:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup) (#1156)\n\n* [Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup)\n\nReplaces the committed, expanded src/Resources/public/studio/build/ tree with a\nsingle content-addressed build-dist/build-<id>.zip that studio-ui-bundle''s\nBuildArchiveExtractionTrait reconstructs at cache warmup. 21 committed build\nfiles become one 320 KB archive, removing the per-build file churn and merge\nconflicts the \"Automatic frontend build\" commits used to cause.\n\n- WebpackEntryPointProvider implements BuildArchiveProviderInterface via the\n  shared trait; the interface_exists() guard is dropped since studio-ui-bundle\n  is a hard composer requirement.\n- rsbuild.config.ts derives the build id from source content (getBuildGroupId +\n  pluginWriteBuildId) instead of a random uuid, and the clean-up step keeps the\n  current build dir because studio-package-build picks the lexicographically\n  greatest .build-id on disk. uuid stays in package.json: it is a runtime\n  dependency and part of the Module Federation shared map.\n- CI switches to reusable-studio-frontend-build-packaged.yaml. build-dist/** is\n  watched on push only, and the push trigger is scoped to the release branches,\n  which it previously was not — without that, the workflow''s own archive commit\n  would retrigger it via push on every feature branch.\n- @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle moves to ^2026.2.10. composer already requires\n  ^2026.2.5, which is past the ^2026.2.1 that first shipped the Build/* classes,\n  so no composer change is needed.\n\nPaths differ from the other Studio bundles: this bundle builds into\nsrc/Resources/public/studio/build, not public/studio/build.\n\nSee https://github.com/pimcore/platform-version/issues/247\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle at ^2026.2.5\n\nThe declared range already satisfies ^2026.2.1, the first version shipping the\nBuild/* classes, the ./bundler/build-id export, pluginWriteBuildId and the\nstudio-package-build CLI — all verified present at 2026.2.5 — so the migration\nneeds no npm bump here. Reverting it takes package-lock.json back to zero diff\nagainst the base and leaves package.json with only the added package-build\nscript.\n\nArchive rebuilt as build-dfc2c6f20b14.zip, since the build id fingerprints the\nmanifests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b5f28b538783fb20aabb06038f605947b3ec159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/9b5f28b538783fb20aabb06038f605947b3ec159"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/af4c421feb6939a26f333595ac3ada925ff3adb3","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b5f28b538783fb20aabb06038f605947b3ec159\nparent 3bc979200d0d14966647e704310785ce7d52d91b\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1789751268 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789751268 +0200\n\n[Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup) (#1156)\n\n* [Studio] Ship frontend build as a committed archive (extracted at cache warmup)\n\nReplaces the committed, expanded src/Resources/public/studio/build/ tree with a\nsingle content-addressed build-dist/build-<id>.zip that studio-ui-bundle''s\nBuildArchiveExtractionTrait reconstructs at cache warmup. 21 committed build\nfiles become one 320 KB archive, removing the per-build file churn and merge\nconflicts the \"Automatic frontend build\" commits used to cause.\n\n- WebpackEntryPointProvider implements BuildArchiveProviderInterface via the\n  shared trait; the interface_exists() guard is dropped since studio-ui-bundle\n  is a hard composer requirement.\n- rsbuild.config.ts derives the build id from source content (getBuildGroupId +\n  pluginWriteBuildId) instead of a random uuid, and the clean-up step keeps the\n  current build dir because studio-package-build picks the lexicographically\n  greatest .build-id on disk. uuid stays in package.json: it is a runtime\n  dependency and part of the Module Federation shared map.\n- CI switches to reusable-studio-frontend-build-packaged.yaml. build-dist/** is\n  watched on push only, and the push trigger is scoped to the release branches,\n  which it previously was not — without that, the workflow''s own archive commit\n  would retrigger it via push on every feature branch.\n- @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle moves to ^2026.2.10. composer already requires\n  ^2026.2.5, which is past the ^2026.2.1 that first shipped the Build/* classes,\n  so no composer change is needed.\n\nPaths differ from the other Studio bundles: this bundle builds into\nsrc/Resources/public/studio/build, not public/studio/build.\n\nSee https://github.com/pimcore/platform-version/issues/247\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle at ^2026.2.5\n\nThe declared range already satisfies ^2026.2.1, the first version shipping the\nBuild/* classes, the ./bundler/build-id export, pluginWriteBuildId and the\nstudio-package-build CLI — all verified present at 2026.2.5 — so the migration\nneeds no npm bump here. Reverting it takes package-lock.json back to zero diff\nagainst the base and leaves package.json with only the added package-build\nscript.\n\nArchive rebuilt as build-dfc2c6f20b14.zip, since the build id fingerprints the\nmanifests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrW/kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAazcQAF/vcD9zdHXHngwDQ1CNhwPg\nja+HV4kPPHAc6rUh+X7o3bRfZqZglrNIkDmhr718Mcmn+JhZcbmd5PsN4J6aPxiT\nN9k7t4vQBIvhMZO0UPHNtIOUq7H1Sm0cxK/xCxzN8AG2CEdUBmEryfYxIabBX6IB\npsFWhQnfLsxsFDc6hR1i1xTMKc+Vc01TckPaTyo0ATp4fy0erhJyc0lX899ODlFF\nVHwRdRZhzW6rAkNgTSHJvpkhdH3Xo1qVkYUX5KH5wNkhFydApDKGUti87ZXwVMJw\n3y/i6cVE1OOf5LY6xIH8hy0y7ZMFFVdoB1/ST6SfwNT0FqTj/To++sqOP80q4