s\nreuse those exact values; glossary pins kept English: Asset, Object\nBrick, Field Collection, Custom Layout, Layout, Workspace). Validated\nwith the studio i18n skill validator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Use an imperative verb for the Polish tree action\n\nEvery other tree.actions.* entry is an imperative (\"Kopiuj\", \"Wklej\",\n\"Usun\"); \"Widok\" is a noun and read as a label rather than an action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5be8d1c38da68792e7c8e0cf8737211f2ddf1db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/e5be8d1c38da68792e7c8e0cf8737211f2ddf1db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/fde8e25acf9a2ebf7729811c4a368ec5ce536306","verification":{"payload":"tree e5be8d1c38da68792e7c8e0cf8737211f2ddf1db\nparent ac8d5e542edb107d754510301cd06ab008296ada\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1789561482 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789561482 +0200\n\n3207 - [Datahub] - Translations (nl, pl) (#1151)\n\n* Add Dutch (nl) and Polish (pl) Studio UI translations\n\nFull translation of studio.en.yaml into nl and pl, consistent with the\nreviewed studio-ui-bundle translations (shared keys and common UI terms\nreuse those exact values; glossary pins kept English: Asset, Object\nBrick, Field Collection, Custom Layout, Layout, Workspace). Validated\nwith the studio i18n skill validator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Use an imperative verb for the Polish tree action\n\nEvery other tree.actions.* entry is an imperative (\"Kopiuj\", \"Wklej\",\n\"Usun\"); \"Widok\" is a noun and read as a label rather than an action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP S