va"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T16:11:57Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"message":"Automatic frontend build","tree":{"sha":"e733847eef76f5efb56d743096267056d17f5462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/e733847eef76f5efb56d743096267056d17f5462"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/88354c2f8268d798a644355a1ba3fff4d79b5893","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/data-hub/commit/88354c2f8268d798a644355a1ba3fff4d79b5893","node_id":"C_kwDOCnS6t9oAKDg4MzU0YzJmODI2OGQ3OThhNjQ0MzU1YTFiYTNmZmY0ZDc5YjU4OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/data-hub/commit/8c0e8753a7ec63d84add319a1de9b0f34a6c1840","sha":"8c0e8753a7ec63d84add319a1de9b0f34a6c1840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/8c0e8753a7ec63d84add319a1de9b0f34a6c1840"}],"sha":"88354c2f8268d798a644355a1ba3fff4d79b5893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/88354c2f8268d798a644355a1ba3fff4d79b5893"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/8c0e8753a7ec63d84add319a1de9b0f34a6c1840/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T16:10:06Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T16:10:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Bug] Fix Sharing/Permissions Add panel being clipped and staying open (#1146)\n\n* [Bug] Fix Sharing/Permissions Add panel being clipped and staying open\n\nThe Add panel in the GraphQL permissions and schema accordions was an\ninline absolutely-positioned div inside the accordion item, which has\noverflow: hidden (bordered table accordion). With a short grid below,\nthe panel was cut off; it also had no outside-click handling, so stale\npanels stayed open when clicking elsewhere or opening another Add panel.\n\nRender the panel in an anchored antd Popover instead: the portal escapes\nthe overflow clipping and the click trigger closes it on outside clicks.\nThe Select popup is kept inside the popover via getPopupContainer so\npicking options does not dismiss the panel.\n\nFixes pimcore/studio-ui-bundle#4023\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Bug] Use a Modal for the Sharing/Permissions and Schema Add flow\n\nThe previous fix rendered the Add panel in an anchored Popover to escape\nthe accordion''s overflow: hidden clipping. Switch to an antd Modal\ninstead, mirroring the pattern used by the Copilot bundle''s Action\nPermissions tab: a modal dialog is never subject to an ancestor''s\noverflow clipping, and it comes with outside-click and Escape handling\nfor free, so the hand-rolled open/close and outside-click logic goes\naway entirely.\n\nRemoves the now-unused InlineDropdownPanel component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"352b9d16b4294650b980c6f6855bbff41d02f605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/352b9d16b4294650b980c6f6855bbff41d02f605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/8c0e8753a7ec63d84add319a1de9b0f34a6c1840","verification":{"payload":"tree 352b9d16b4294650b980c6f6855bbff41d02f605\nparent 2c7ea81512cdf0a7122ec7f70aa14ff50284d6ce\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1788279006 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788279006 +0200\n\n[Bug] Fix Sharing/Permissions Add panel being clipped and staying open (#1146)\n\n* [Bug] Fix Sharing/Permissions Add panel being clipped and staying open\n\nThe Add panel in the GraphQL permissions and schema accordions was an\ninline absolutely-positioned div inside the accordion item, which has\noverflow: hidden (bordered table accordion). With a short grid below,\nthe panel was cut off; it also had no outside-click handling, so stale\npanels stayed open when clicking elsewhere or opening another Add panel.\n\nRender the panel in an anchored antd Popover instead: the portal escapes\nthe overflow clipping and the click trigger closes it on outside clicks.\nThe Select popup is kept inside the popover via getPopupContainer so\npicking options does not dismiss the panel.\n\nFixes pimcore/studio-ui-bundle#4023\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* [Bug] Use a Modal for the Sharing/Permissions and Schema Add flow\n\nThe previous fix rendered the Add panel in an anchored Popover to escape\nthe accordion''s overflow: hidden clipping. Switch to an antd Modal\ninstead, mirroring the pattern used by the Copilot bundle''s Action\nPermissions tab: a modal dialog is never subject to an ancestor''s\noverflow clipping, and it comes with outside-click and Escape handling\nfor free, so the hand-rolled open/close and outside-click logic goes\naway entirely.\n\nRemoves the now-unused InlineDropdownPanel component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP S