l":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/a2db71816571eb85d17ec6ba4bcaabf41d656f58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:45:42Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:45:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Do not persist the checkout token in fork-PR contexts (shared FE workflows) (#1143)\n\nFollow-up to #1134, applying the reviewer-flagged mitigation: under\npull_request_target the checkout otherwise persists the contents:write\nGITHUB_TOKEN into .git/config, where fork-controlled npm scripts can read\nit. Credentials are now persisted only when the head is same-repo — the\nsame condition that already gates the git-auto-commit steps, which keep\nworking unchanged. Fork-PR jobs become read-only.\n\nFull restructure (read-only fork jobs + separate trusted write-back job)\nstays with the pull_request_target review in service-operations#1083.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72a0f9a91148fc67bbfa40f9bbabd63c191e3f12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/72a0f9a91148fc67bbfa40f9bbabd63c191e3f12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/a2db71816571eb85d17ec6ba4bcaabf41d656f58","verification":{"payload":"tree 72a0f9a91148fc67bbfa40f9bbabd63c191e3f12\nparent 178b70fb09dcdf6086faf316a0c070bd016312f4\nauthor berfinyuksel <99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com> 1786715142 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786715142 +0200\n\nDo not persist the checkout token in fork-PR contexts (shared FE workflows) (#1143)\n\nFollow-up to #1134, applying the reviewer-flagged mitigation: under\npull_request_target the checkout otherwise persists the contents:write\nGITHUB_TOKEN into .git/config, where fork-controlled npm scripts can read\nit. Credentials are now persisted only when the head is same-repo — the\nsame condition that already gates the git-auto-commit steps, which keep\nworking unchanged. Fork-PR jobs become read-only.\n\nFull restructure (read-only fork jobs + separate trusted write-back job)\nstays with the pull_request_target review in service-operations#1083.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfxwGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoS4QAK1dLeVY3+/xP7U7TWnH/6xU\ntek3SaPjmstvTZv8bSnr0vr1V1anK/dE5qRu+m9CNs2vbSkjvSPl5R2be+bp4jLs\nHboKkXm+m5g43UZc8Rh6Xow5vYJT5djL5nalx36WTjTtTRVd0+HBW7r5X0pV+2I8\nI6tZpDR/152MbAtVNq8p20pzX+/ktI2nFmH8jhBv4uHihJ5sYY0/rH9Xv5RpwVAw\n09l4W/kGY7JZvUr3g0NDJpDgHIOat+wClwRKTrqG0IXUjIMpKGVlN29eUizUPTHS\nfoGul5rbbARBoLwf20eyiEWM4OS9tfeBpInQQa4m6iXr5B2b+rfk0M1emo5C1J25\nAaUqbIhG5tOqLW5rF0+2jiZB1kMzgZS5+qKGl+Pv/1SErjEf6MrcQOkDneel4h2S\nx4MN4z9VHHkp9xruZyHMoNBAR1xxaJr3+ZNCKBtk3IW2maZiI6MNcJQ2D748IYgw\ntgZz2x8ZYaYvvFMX3WumtxP+TeV8WSLdoV2mnWZu5jFSQItcRMdEonNzDDkgXXsG\nteTiqrQ5EWTJV4IfMAEFp1YpxcFplPnoRQZ5FFrIA1/CJfYVQ1+38lht2uFBBa66\ndKwNOUlQe3op/hG0aPM71FapCWeEBUML03WePXpD0BoJ9njNShmjIFjGSjcmXOuc\nnEnij173m4shAWydYrIR\n=zqEF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T13:45:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri