.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/commits/095d15693136f5b4af6c15e23e7a66a87d9b9824/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:39:29Z","email":"7668379+bluvulture@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shonster88"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:39:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix frontend workflows checkout for private-fork PRs (#1134)\n\nshared-frontend-build.yaml and shared-npm-publish.yaml checked out the\nPR head directly from the fork repository (head.repo.full_name). That\nworks for public forks, but private forks (partner orgs) are not\nreadable by this repo''s GITHUB_TOKEN, so the fetch failed with\n\"remote: Repository not found.\" and every job aborted at checkout.\nfrontend-build-pr.yaml triggers on pull_request_target, so every\nprivate-fork PR hit this.\n\nFork PRs now fetch refs/pull/<n>/head from the base repo — GitHub\nmirrors every PR''s head commits there regardless of fork visibility.\nSame-repo and push/tag runs keep their previous refs. The two\ngit-auto-commit steps are additionally gated to same-repo contexts:\npushing to a fork branch was never possible, and on the detached\nrefs/pull/<n>/head checkout the action would fail instead of being\nskipped.\n\nSame fix as pimcore/workflows-collection-public#142.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 4315812a9bced97685260646039ccfd165bfe025)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0bc05e5bef15af4c5d254f2f43191a206544a6e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/trees/0bc05e5bef15af4c5d254f2f43191a206544a6e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-hub/git/commits/095d15693136f5b4af6c15e23e7a66a87d9b9824","verification":{"payload":"tree 0bc05e5bef15af4c5d254f2f43191a206544a6e2\nparent efab60aec023a2204ffb716ec535bc3230543a6e\nauthor Shonster88 <7668379+bluvulture@users.noreply.github.com> 1786714769 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786714769 +0200\n\nFix frontend workflows checkout for private-fork PRs (#1134)\n\nshared-frontend-build.yaml and shared-npm-publish.yaml checked out the\nPR head directly from the fork repository (head.repo.full_name). That\nworks for public forks, but private forks (partner orgs) are not\nreadable by this repo''s GITHUB_TOKEN, so the fetch failed with\n\"remote: Repository not found.\" and every job aborted at checkout.\nfrontend-build-pr.yaml triggers on pull_request_target, so every\nprivate-fork PR hit this.\n\nFork PRs now fetch refs/pull/<n>/head from the base repo — GitHub\nmirrors every PR''s head commits there regardless of fork visibility.\nSame-repo and push/tag runs keep their previous refs. The two\ngit-auto-commit steps are additionally gated to same-repo contexts:\npushing to a fork branch was never possible, and on the detached\nrefs/pull/<n>/head checkout the action would fail instead of being\nskipped.\n\nSame fix as pimcore/workflows-collection-public#142.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 4315812a9bced97685260646039ccfd165bfe025)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfxqRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAChkQAEzoYPyHvC8Pmhl7TdpgR2+f\nrJMFePyL8aY46XBRXOe2QyqEAvsrtPVT3moTbsE2/t1rWHGFm/whQgGaKFr+qGEN\nY5eqqXGxzkKq1rjTJWn0OfCHBP5kmSt0f3U5NmNCT8eOlPWCz0i31RRv3BmZlOvS\nF/OrkHM/FrW7rkaQvdRdvh7IcnTYKb6TxtVEtj0BqNdBTY1jK2ny0oCUjkUN/qnU\nCbPKIf43+FtO6ScAtFKQEDpMulfwzbCc6pyKSP1nN5dsUgqmskOGmQDSTAfH9VJD\ng/0C+AQ1T61DiEKhxuWAmYBa3fJm51Vcn2TTs6Xqi1md5nMCKKVB1/7pdiCmV7md\nKt8DegU6ORhfITDyJRCJsHY33YQS/HOihxLwf2nFOIGzv0Zs8EqymxBR2KQ/X1Td\nFpN34PcY4OpUrEe2tZOIoBMNY8U30F7q5C7JfkbAUkPi0heh5sKKQGDgiMA1ZAiU\ngmCKEh/YJiKus9ednckVfzghS/HjStM83WP7wVVER8rC8t3F/XyXkgBe8ja0JcEO\nwGHjraUddyTtOniOlMMALQhRAPpjHPLy32S8qXQhgFa+i78RXWqpN49CISa5wZrN\naYy19IrjfBVKc8JQYjDdeoi/FcMVVpc9QLp232lcde6u3yCTqicxXvRH6hjRLKmm\n1Egesh8F4B0l41qAXQAc\n=VcEP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T13:39:34Z"}},"committer":{"av