"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AnselmMarie","id":11258082,"login":"AnselmMarie","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjU4MDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnselmMarie","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AnselmMarie/anselmmarie.github.io/commits/6073c9f00763af4c3cf0804f0ab5920fc0603cb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T19:52:19Z","email":"AnselmMarie@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anselm Marie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T19:52:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/amarie/portfolio updates (#46)\n\n* feat: rework the homepage — hide the featured panel and six work cards, add two, sort by year, 2×2 grid\n\n- Hide six work cards (Pokémon Pet Shop, Company Development, New App\n  Skin, CSP Generator App, Caterpillar Inc., CosMikata older version);\n  their items and /portfolio/$slug pages stay.\n- Add two placeholder items: Micro Frontend Architecture Migration\n  (Southern Glazer''s, 2025) and From Prototype to New Company Division\n  (Cricket Wireless, 2017).\n- Sort the work grid newest year first and lay it out 2×2 on desktop.\n- Drop the Live pill; update Breeze-Thru (2018, Design · JavaScript,\n  new lede) and Cosmikata (2025).\n- Hide the hero''s featured panel and give the hero more vertical room.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add vertical spacing around the shell''s fallback card\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: give every portfolio item Timeline, Role and Focus facts, renaming Outcome to Focus\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: rebuild the portfolio detail page against the project-detail design (Slice 15)\n\n- Header strip: client/year/role meta row and outbound link pills\n- Hero card on the item''s Work-card colour, holding the page h1, lede,\n  role chip, and the first gallery image washed in at low opacity\n- Overview on surface: tech chips, fact table, summary, and the sanitized\n  HTML description under a Details eyebrow (D78, invented)\n- Videos re-skinned as their own section (D78, invented)\n- Gallery tiles derived from authored dimensions (D86)\n- Dark \"Want the deeper walkthrough?\" block, stopping at the rule (D79)\n- Moves: unavailable -> portfolio-item/, description + sanitizer ->\n  portfolio-item-overview/ (contents of the sanitizer unchanged)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: 3-column work grid, restore older Cosmikata card, add v3 placeholder, rename CosMikata to Cosmikata\n\n- Lay the work grid out three columns from the frame breakpoint up.\n- Restore the Cosmikata (older version) card; five cards stay hidden.\n- Add a v3 placeholder item (Anselm Marie, 2026, React · TanStack Start)\n  with an invented summary line and card colour.\n- Rename CosMikata to Cosmikata across the older item''s title, lede,\n  image alts and video titles.\n- Move the placeholder-item specs into their own file to stay under the\n  200-line cap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add top spacing to the open Experience accordion panel\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: show tall and small gallery screenshots at their own size instead of cropping or upscaling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add the Cricket Enterprise Admin Platform card, hide older Cosmikata, and refresh portfolio copy and Cosmikata screenshots\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1298c600c8728b3296837d643685b6fa70ec99de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AnselmMarie/anselmmarie.github.io/git/trees/1298c600c8728b3296837d643685b6fa70ec99de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AnselmMarie/anselmmarie.github.io/git/commits/6073c9f00763af4c3cf0804f0ab5920fc0603cb5","verification":{"payload":"tree 1298c600c8728b3296837d643685b6fa70ec99de\nparent ab5c1391b527e8e4f9bd92b0e3f88293239260c2\nauthor Anselm Marie <AnselmMarie@users.noreply.github.com> 1790193139 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790193139 -0400\n\nFeat/amarie/portfolio updates (#46)\n\n* feat: rework the homepage — hide the featured panel and six work cards, add two, sort by year, 2×2 grid\n\n- Hide six work cards (Pokémon Pet Shop, Company Development, New App\n  Skin, CSP Generator App, Caterpillar Inc., CosMikata older version);\n  their items and /portfolio/$slug pages stay.\n- Add two placeholder items: Micro Frontend Architecture Migration\n  (Southern Glazer''s, 2025) and From Prototype to New Company Division\n  (Cricket Wireless, 2017).\n- Sort the work grid newest year first and lay it out 2×2 on desktop.\n- Drop the Live pill; update Breeze-Thru (2018, Design · JavaScript,\n  new lede) and Cosmikata (2025).\n- Hide the hero''s featured panel and give the hero more vertical room.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add vertical spacing around the shell''s fallback card\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: give every portfolio item Timeline, Role and Focus facts, renaming Outcome to Focus\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anth