ild): upgrade maven-jar-plugin to 3.5.1 (#613)\n\n* fix(build): upgrade maven-jar-plugin to 3.5.1\n\nRHCLOUD-51503\nRemove explicit jar goal from maven-jar-plugin execution to fix\n\"supplemental artifacts\" error in 3.x. The default jar goal is\nautomatically bound for jar packaging — the duplicate caused the\nbuild to fail. Also remove empty configuration block.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(gitignore): exlcude goose thoughts folder\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charles Mulder <1179063+charlesmulder@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d68add3f1dd2b5907128800368eb1a5f260c64d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/javascript-clients/git/trees/1d68add3f1dd2b5907128800368eb1a5f260c64d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/javascript-clients/git/commits/91595794f69f4445d2331fe73bc90754a6e55d31","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d68add3f1dd2b5907128800368eb1a5f260c64d\nparent 296be9ae042e8b7fb9aa1de258122617d58529aa\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790242484 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790242484 +0100\n\nchore(build): upgrade maven-jar-plugin to 3.5.1 (#613)\n\n* fix(build): upgrade maven-jar-plugin to 3.5.1\n\nRHCLOUD-51503\nRemove explicit jar goal from maven-jar-plugin execution to fix\n\"supplemental artifacts\" error in 3.x. The default jar goal is\nautomatically bound for jar packaging — the duplicate caused the\nbuild to fail. Also remove empty configuration block.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(gitignore): exlcude goose thoughts folder\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charles Mulder <1179063+charlesmulder@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtO60CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj2oQAFB2NlmqDFDmbJe8Fab+BSxI\nhqPP4Ql3/SuEUYmC5i9UAP5VYsCKv31HcVx71ln