615df898bf216ec223a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:56:25Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T16:56:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(RHCLOUD-50364): migrate ESLint to flat config (#553)\n\n* refactor(workspace): migrate ESLint from legacy eslintrc to flat config\n\nRHCLOUD-50364\n\nRun `nx g @nx/eslint:convert-to-inferred` to remove explicit lint\nexecutor targets, then manually convert all 19 .eslintrc.json/.eslintrc\nfiles to flat eslint.config.js format.\n\n- Root eslint.config.js: Nx flat/base + flat/typescript presets,\n  eslint-plugin-prettier/recommended, jsonc rules, module boundaries\n- Each package eslint.config.js: imports root config, adds\n  @nx/dependency-checks with per-package ignoredDependencies and\n  preserves all explanatory comments\n- Delete .eslintignore (patterns moved into config ignores)\n- nx.json: scope first @nx/eslint/plugin to apps only, clean up\n  stale .eslintrc.json/.eslintignore input references\n- Deprecation warning for @nx/eslint:lint executor is eliminated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(eslint): exclude dist/ from root ignores to prevent lint failures on locally-built packages\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charles Mulder <1179063+charlesmulder@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe74fa2a5e1c85e6c134bfa752a8a1e10728c6f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/javascript-clients/git/trees/fe74fa2a5e1c85e6c134bfa752a8a1e10728c6f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/javascript-clients/git/commits/9820499eb3c4ffc688929615df898bf216ec223a","verification":{"payload":"tree fe74fa2a5e1c85e6c134bfa752a8a1e10728c6f1\nparent 0293497d45206206f6e333d2ec6545dab37e3750\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1786726585 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com