ng_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/30876b575fc2ba84588e96914cff12596c80e130/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:47:40Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T05:47:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: format the outline tab''s sequence due dates in the learner''s timezone preference (#2149)\n\n`SequenceDueDate` read `userTimezone` as a top-level key of the outline tab\ndata, where it has never existed: the endpoint carries `user_timezone` only\ninside `dates_widget`. PR #606 moved the outline tab''s timezone reads to the\ncourse-home metadata but in `SequenceLink` only removed the `datesWidget`\nnesting, so the read has yielded `undefined` since and sequence due dates\nhave formatted in the browser''s zone. Read it from `useCourseHomeMeta`, as\nthe tab''s other date displays do, and name the field on `CourseHomeMeta`.\n\nCloses #2148\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50aa56e02cba3a6d2a439752fb870d5758ec3e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/50aa56e02cba3a6d2a439752fb870d5758ec3e0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/30876b575fc2ba84588e96914cff12596c80e130","verification":{"payload":"tree 50aa56e02cba3a6d2a439752fb870d5758ec3e0a\nparent 338196b8f9337ada07fe41a4ea54f74f419e93c9\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1790920060 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790920060 -0400\n\nfix: format the outline tab''s sequence due dates in the learner''s timezone preference (#2149)\n\n`SequenceDueDate` read `userTimezone` as a top-level key of the outline tab\ndata, where it has never existed: the endpoint carries `user_timezone` only\ninside `dates_widget`. PR #606 moved the outline tab''s timezone reads to the\ncourse-home metadata but in `SequenceLink` only removed the `datesWidget`\nnesting, so the read has yielded `undefined` since and sequence due dates\nhave formatted in the browser''s zone. Read it from `useCourseHomeMeta`, as\nthe tab''s other date displays do, and name the field on `CourseHomeMeta`.\n\nCloses #2148\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv0V8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANfYQAAldX3H3B73wSy10ZbqcHJm4\nI81L7vk8rhKQHEPpdsL79jHfF+AehTtIq4d7iNhN46vRd4Dzby2q/KxT8W4jO9VA\n80l3w4tmgZ8gZyroTYemsXS6QY4rjIrb9yXrPyTfQ4gw7BnaDs6PIEsX5jZ5PHCm\nE2Or74C6j1UUgPp5kJYcuif3FV0gN0gGcH66poI44lnGqcHXY6c+huxkarNOGFAW\nxuewET0i4VZUZkQWpLaY8GpvlMaCiI+LASmEvCTcCArHBmPwpOr+lFbmYUgJxZAH\ndlRYKsrFiK7GsikTaOh9q9Cnq9OOOvj6PRTTsptAEsnOPA72bLQnR7ChFi1R/7WF\nabqBz+ZeyQRqmNh1rvnx7S+hAk6V9Z5BzVUaohni+vu6aKSmV8aIU7mKiFE8yD6R\n+VkvaJWlAE4uGnS7H4htw0Sb3kwFCO3e7HW9ha4oYYNBdM4KJGb398kBcqlsnd8H\nWSa2fT1N6m1ioRfbba/5NbPHrnH68aGGy8naXul5d2lb0fI9sIbZUiEFmcasjJM3\nG2EAZ1T9jq0gnGiQDGy0+IlVgg7RdxxExgIOrvtFA8fLszV/ryVfu6NeRe/8z07/\nDpKd5p1OTVa7niQbQ5cHu3bMu2ebRvREiL5LUi2U69wpSAzgmUTHwrlKqjmWt97g\nuPxKrjWVv7yMBK+Xclz1\n=ftkI\n