nd-app-learning/commits/12de1ec6fbf20df2dedd733a137e4cee320a6fc8"}],"sha":"8c4af0c8ded1199e7df0f619677f0c4fed524d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/8c4af0c8ded1199e7df0f619677f0c4fed524d5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/12de1ec6fbf20df2dedd733a137e4cee320a6fc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:21:42Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:21:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: convert Unit, UnitSuspense, UnitTitleSlot and BookmarkButton to TypeScript (#2126)\n\nPeeled out of the units layer of #2088, which threads a `sequenceId` through\nall four: with `Props` interfaces in place, that layer changes a type in each\ninstead of adding four `propTypes` entries.\n\n- `git mv` to `.tsx`; `propTypes` become a `Props` interface with\n  destructuring defaults (`format = null`, `isBookmarked = false`) in place\n  of the two `defaultProps`, the `UnitButton.tsx` shape in the same subtree.\n  JavaScript imports stay untyped at this layer.\n- `UnitTitleSlot`''s `unit` shape becomes a local interface with\n  `bookmarkedUpdateState` optional: the sequence endpoint never sends it and\n  the bookmark writer sets it, so a fresh unit never had it despite the\n  `isRequired`.\n- `getIFrameUrl` encodes its `preview` boolean itself. `Unit` passed\n  `shouldDisplayUnitPreview ? ''1'' : ''0''` into a parameter declared `boolean`\n  and sent as `String(preview)`, because the endpoint compares\n  `request.GET.get(''preview'', ''0'') == ''1''`; the builder''s own case named\n  \"url param equals 1\" asserted `preview=true`. The builder now sends\n  `preview ? ''1'' : ''0''`, `Unit` passes the boolean, and the `urls.test.ts`\n  expectations say `preview=0` / `preview=1`. `Unit` passes `jumpToId` as\n  `undefined` when the param is absent, where `URLSearchParams.get` gives\n  `null`. No request changes.\n\nPart of #1946. Closes #2125.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c39488e3e75fd85bd6b2f8bb5c6a4c9f8c8120bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/c39488e3e75fd85bd6b2f8bb5c6a4c9f8c8120bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/12de1ec6fbf20df2dedd733a137e4cee320a6fc8","verification":{"payload":"tree c39488e3e75fd85bd6b2f8bb5c6a4c9f8c8120bd\nparent 034285cb415c346e7042d14f8dafa8714d184c9f\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1790587302 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790587302 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert Unit, UnitSuspense, UnitTitleSlot and BookmarkButton to TypeScript (#2126)\n\nPeeled out of the units layer of #2088, which threads a `sequenceId` through\nall four: with `Props` interfaces in place, that layer changes a type in each\ninstead of adding four `propTypes` entries.\n\n- `git mv` to `.tsx`; `propTypes` become a `Props` interface with\n  destructuring defaults (`format = null`, `isBookmarked = false`) in place\n  of the two `defaultProps`, the `UnitButton.tsx` shape in the same subtree.\n  JavaScript imports stay untyped at this layer.\n- `UnitTitleSlot`''s `unit` shape becomes a local interface with\n  `bookmarkedUpdateState` optional: the sequence endpoint never sends it and\n  the bookmark writer sets it, so a fresh unit never had it despite the\n  `isRequired`.\n- `getIFrameUrl` encodes its `preview` boolean itself. `Unit` passed\n  `shouldDisplayUnitPreview ? ''1'' : ''0''` into a parameter declared `boolean`\n  and sent as `String(preview)`, because the endpoint compares\n  `request.GET.get(''preview'', ''0'') == ''1''`; the builder''s own case named\n  \"url param equals 1\" asserted `preview=true`. The builder now sends\n  `preview ? ''1'' : ''0''`, `Unit` passes the boolean, and the `urls.test.ts`\n  expectations say `preview=0` / `preview=1`. `Unit` passes `jumpToId` as\n  `undefined` when the param is absent, where `URLSearchParams.get` gives\n  `null`. No request changes.\n\nPart of #1946. Closes #2125.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqujGmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC6EQAJttao1nLOnVo8fvOaf3YSQk\n4hBLpkzWtTeijWaHtnYUWXorRFeNanEUgK0ovWcLkuzvga1pe7VkiOWhlvk3Abr9\n6WsO9JlgnOdoQ2vVshrK/ocTBqQHwVngISPznLS8ae3suMNtofxD4NBM/4fmA/6e\n7R10K+kAII3En0u1Fxrtm9LNPJsfYn9P/7WxDghUKPH2ZxAyW81Ux7YM/EPxYFkV\nIT0Nt3cTjEb51yEyObuZTocy/Fljt9dof7G5T2+rEF/Ff53fTo6nKsvKhU4eIag/\nXoTh1PZ3NM9hgkAubxHoN+bgGQQdMoKjw4Uuqqgvf5s9+FhL5ikWrQ57PaUrftZw\nJYb5XYHSUdhQbYleuUAqof0Gb46NYUzLj3ssQ9rY3cNm5z5meUSOWgH24pTLG2/y\nmsBLIjKs6uZy0x/A55OVLRzcb773Mm2gxeK0MRcOCPweBoep9Avyq+v0fE8+8wxs\n7tJU88mmmtP9NVR+8Dwo6K2F7VRGsM1WJJhzFgyvVKE2TIaljIwFzmXk6bjEVWG2\nULqBkedJkcbXleiMppBTRDMsuQag2gYgtUD+NDO4xw+KjODuo