","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/a51108e1db95043ecc1e8ffb21fee0a808320d0a","node_id":"C_kwDOCvycV9oAKGE1MTEwOGUxZGI5NTA0M2VjYzFlOGZmYjIxZmVlMGE4MDgzMjBkMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/18c7742c5c1228d1258c1d3f427f555150469d16","sha":"18c7742c5c1228d1258c1d3f427f555150469d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/18c7742c5c1228d1258c1d3f427f555150469d16"}],"sha":"a51108e1db95043ecc1e8ffb21fee0a808320d0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/a51108e1db95043ecc1e8ffb21fee0a808320d0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/18c7742c5c1228d1258c1d3f427f555150469d16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:44:54Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:44:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: retire the courseHome Redux slice (#2081)\n\nThe slice''s last live field, proctoringPanelStatus, was a loading flag\nfor the proctoring onboarding fetch: set by ProctoringInfoPanel when the\nrequest settled, read by OutlineTab to defer the weekly-goal card and by\nProductTours to hold the outline tour. The fetch becomes\nuseProctoringInfoData in course-home/data/apiHooks.ts and both readers\ngate on its isPending; the panel derives its display from the query\ndata instead of six useStates, with the readable-status derivation\nmoved to outline-tab/utils.ts. retry: false keeps the immediate settle\nthe flag was designed for (PR #727), while a non-404 failure now reaches\nthe app QueryCache logging instead of being swallowed.\n\nProductTours keys the query on the courseHomeMeta username the panel\nuses — which follows masquerade — rather than its own authenticated\nusername.\n\nslice.js and course-home/data/index.js are deleted; courseHome leaves\nstore.ts and the test store. The store is now models + specialExams +\nplugins.\n\nCloses #1975\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74d889db2ddd070340592ebf8eefc037289bc46a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/74d889db2ddd070340592ebf8eefc037289bc46a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/18c7742c5c1228d1258c1d3f427f555150469d16","verification":{"payload":"tree 74d889db2ddd070340592ebf8eefc037289bc46a\nparent f4fb4fde451287c530aa80b4accc66dda143c36f\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789973094 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789973094 -0400\n\nrefactor: retire the courseHome Redux slice (#2081)\n\nThe slice''s last live field, proctoringPanelStatus, was a loading flag\nfor the proctoring onboarding fetch: set by ProctoringInfoPanel when the\nrequest settled, read by OutlineTab to defer the weekly-goal card and by\nProductTours to hold the outline tour. The fetch becomes\nuseProctoringInfoData in course-home/data/apiHooks.ts and both readers\ngate on its isPending; the panel derives its display from the query\ndata instead of six useStates, with the readable-status derivation\nmoved to outline-tab/utils.ts. retry: false keeps the immediate settle\nthe flag was designed for (PR #727), while a non-404 failure now reaches\nthe app QueryCache logging instead of being swallowed.\n\nProductTours keys the query on the courseHomeMeta username the panel\nuses — which follows masquerade — rather than its own authenticated\nusername.\n\nslice.js and course-home/data/index.js are deleted; courseHome leaves\nstore.ts and the test store. The store is now models + specialExams +\nplugins.\n\nCloses #1975\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsNJmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUfEQAFy/ONX9RfIdU4HOWPOBQQzW\naUKBBgMwqiWcuFwZETY15k4DHQXDyyZaaDrtxWrhC25Z7RoiWvquvLEPvwqc0DV0\nblLKojEiCH0VR6V4fjOhQKtR/yHyV9cmmmrBk51NJPcgZjnj3OtbdkF7p+hpR76f\nO1lmsT9hfmjyATce1wnZA+OTJfxW2z8tyQZt3jN/dncV6vZhSOMXu47ywLMdeKUB\n+UxIYUguPZ8uS3glFSdBG/lnEwZsTNmfG9Bda3yBQiC7AMGau6cDEjTwDY9Gxlsi\nXExss7HBuDKu2i9D59mRSzWR+4RWBbO8XozksrZtt0PkH9rEWhCJIJpz7ZWa9flm\nfi41698Q0nf8ROZQ42b4VCrR9KA1OMkegnYDxX5U4NYm5SMlhzla0Fs1osKk89P9\nXBjoox9Aw6dgTodWsug/aqEKdAZUfLVzHxkFoBP5HEqciLgfqrmkY84lYoB1JsNT\n6peRFsq1bZbnGTkRdTZaK6IoeFLiuoE4jGdRfNZ4fTL2RNvTJQUGqXCcWs