learning/commits/548688d1bc950271ba570559a10a206ac2b95fd4"}],"sha":"97c2d39dbe99b66e2fc9382ea2952960bfb088a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/97c2d39dbe99b66e2fc9382ea2952960bfb088a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/548688d1bc950271ba570559a10a206ac2b95fd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:15:26Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:15:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: restore the 403 detail message on query-converted course-home tabs (#2073)\n\nThe old shared fetchTab thunk extracted detail/error_code from a 403 body\ninto fetchTabFailure, which TabPage rendered; the tab conversions removed\nits dispatchers tab by tab, leaving state.courseHome.errorMessage\npermanently null — converted tabs have shown the generic failure text where\nthey used to show the 403''s detail. TabPage''s query branch now sources the\nmessage from the metadata query error itself, via accessErrorDetail in\ndata/http-error.ts (which already models the body shape); string callers\nkeep the slice-sourced message until the teardown layer removes that branch.\nThe two sources are a branch on the courseStatus shape, not a fallback\nchain — they are the same message on two transports from different eras.\nerrorCode is not carried over; nothing ever read it.\n\nPart of #1976.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f079342628ef110091e88229e755b30930b63859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/f079342628ef110091e88229e755b30930b63859"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/548688d1bc950271ba570559a10a206ac2b95fd4","verification":{"payload":"tree f079342628ef110091e88229e755b30930b63859\nparent 45e800b2d76d90acbecd26a307fd3844baf99e10\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789794926 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789794926 -0400\n\nfix: restore the 403 detail message on query-converted course-home tabs (#2073)\n\nThe old shared fetchTab thunk extracted detail/error_code from a 403 body\ninto fetchTabFailure, which TabPage rendered; the tab conversions removed\nits dispatchers tab by tab, leaving state.courseHome.errorMessage\npermanently null — converted tabs have shown the generic failure text where\nthey used to show the 403''s detail. TabPage''s query branch now sources the\nmessage from the metadata query error itself, via accessErrorDetail in\ndata/http-error.ts (which already models the body shape); string callers\nkeep the slice-sourced message until the teardown layer removes that branch.\nThe two sources are a branch on the courseStatus shape, not a fallback\nchain — they are the same message on two transports from different eras.\nerrorCode is not carried over; nothing ever read it.\n\nPart of #1976.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrhpuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwIsQAD1LknUxVgB40jY8O+REBauF\ne6xe2c/9gUlqjB9qxZlnEJX+i3n1+lvn0Wa4vOvQcSx6VtP6IkMGFZDYVOFI0f9P\n9l5S7g85y+yRV3TnLPTPmS7pAzmFjtUI3BBY/g9q+UOsA1t6C9sJrlU52NQ1Hgyj\nw6ZRlyFUCDlTQ7AQAuY+dMYcwslZNlWPkDWa99byQgmjIaFA+PTy3xXvCxa/EG1s\nEIsdgI06w9C70gKs8CFfsDQBv2YCRm8tpB67W/Q4jHb88Ga4pp+dVDg+QSeEFfex\nstorLp+j+rgyjQ7TdX8zcZbygNaDmTiNIAR46Xkv7ZX7WFbCodV1m+7GFpr4GO2c\nftc0nMuYhLigDKHQ5tEKNvm43E5nFKU634Y4OwWjZjariPvh9usZCUiSNKw2NaX1\nWB71ULBctc/PeinwR2czXPNN3+8A1ln7DIGGpmlYbK7Y2NIOmuBGrO9wQDu8XdU9\nDltgmj3xUR+1KB2N+ND6NCipF/muTrMs9eNkn1L1rxHtNmNr3n3xvx3QRPPo+WyU\n4in/N9jPPm09fRHlvUbuzAO22EeL4ynT5Xw2MqTK2LQAi4XkUBNpX4CAv95Pz7E5\n+gBIwjvaF6VjeYtCnWgzbVN5fcYuOCAy3DrZlBylCAYzZzDf5Wzd03eDeG2cMJNQ\n9fi2Kqzr2KQuGNDrm/5u\n=sb+h\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T05:15:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/548688d1bc950271ba570559a10a206ac2b95fd4","node_id":"C_kwDOCvycV9oAKDU0ODY4OGQxYmM5NTAyNzFiYTU3MDU1OWExMGEyMDZhYzJiOTVmZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/45e800b2d76d90acbecd26a307fd3844baf99e10","sha":"45e800b2d76d90acbecd26a307fd3844baf99e10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/45e800b2d76d90acbecd26a307fd3844baf99e10"}],"sha":"548688d1bc950271ba570559a10a206ac2b95fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/548688d1bc950271ba570559a10a206ac2b95fd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/45e800b2d76d90acbecd26a307fd3844baf99e10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T03:12:03Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T03:12:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: gate CourseBreadcrumbs on the queries (#2072)\n\nCourseBreadcrumbs swaps the slice''s courseStatus/sequenceStatus strings for\nuseIsCourseLoaded(courseId) and useSequenceMetadata(sequenceId).isSuccess —\nboth ids were already props. Model reads are untouched. With this, the\ntransitional status bridge''s only remaining readers are CoursewareContainer\nand TabPage.\n\nPart of #1976.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13f3851dad2a19f547c781dc9e93d15b46350e22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/13f3851dad2a19f547c781dc9e93d15b46350e22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/45e800b2d76d90acbecd26a307fd3844baf99e10","verification":{"payload":"tree 13f3851dad2a19f547c781dc9e93d15b46350e22\nparent 3f133b8c10ab29a9d1fa9c2d58157db62c566bad\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789787523 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789787523 -0400\n\nrefactor: gate CourseBreadcrumbs on the queries (#2072)\n\nCourseBreadcrumbs swaps the slice''s courseStatus/sequenceStatus strings for\nuseIsCourseLoaded(courseId) and useSequenceMetadata(sequenceId).isSuccess —\nboth ids were already props. Model reads are untouched. With this, the\ntransitional status bridge''s only remaining readers are CoursewareContainer\nand TabPage.\n\nPart of #1976.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrf2ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc4IQAANUbpdWdKiswrymmZ5Of/WX\nAQbX0/e9ikL+9ziS+4cy9c/aE007cXz7szguoodA4mzknh9sBZ/HuBSRJTJBXR0q\n2ObyFFzcE7Q3lPxOQA291jVYkF1Xw8rq9qoSJf6sLO8Ym8PjRgehmNM9pLQqH55T\n2vdpWjIfCef3eKHJKhFsvBru5wW9iMCk7i8iPq0zzD3TBh8YfEz7P2nZ7NHJwh7t\n1ONl929EzypAigQ1bN6UiB0l0suW9ayidLzRMG+NbJ+Jk92E3ia/lMgiRK2nYcN0\nvyx19pUgnZELTxNvMXCG9BvcEfGRaSjY5os8SLQsZXsLp8TxfR1JQt/bpU3ZS