":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/d0996516f9226145da3c8bb8ae54091facb7217e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T19:57:35Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T19:57:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor!: convert getCourseDiscussionTopics to React Query (#2068)\n\nThe last courseware thunk becomes prefetchDiscussionTopics in\ncourseware/data/apiHooks.ts — a plain prefetchQuery wrapper, not a hook,\nsince its only consumer is the imperative widget-registry prefetch effect\nin SidebarContextProvider. The provider gate (topics only for the openedx\nprovider) moves inside queryFn, the model-store bridge learns idField so\nthe discussionTopics model stays keyed by usageKey, and useDispatch\nleaves SidebarContextProvider. The useModel readers are untouched\n(#1977), and courseware/data/thunks.js is deleted.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the sidebar widget prefetch contract no longer receives\ndispatch — the context object is now { courseId, course, queryClient }.\nExternal SIDEBAR_WIDGETS whose prefetch dispatched a Redux thunk must\nfetch via the provided React Query client instead.\n\nCloses #2016\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bb71f7f80bd5b39581d99fed0be6a21ef7a9061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/7bb71f7f80bd5b39581d99fed0be6a21ef7a9061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/d0996516f9226145da3c8bb8ae54091facb7217e","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bb71f7f80bd5b39581d99fed0be6a21ef7a9061\nparent 7dd75bd39423fea1b6cb0c9e9ccf6fcbb96165cc\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789761455 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789761455 -0400\n\nrefactor!: convert getCourseDiscussionTopics to React Query (#2068)\n\nThe last courseware thunk becomes prefetchDiscussionTopics in\ncourseware/data/apiHooks.ts — a plain prefetchQuery wrapper, not a hook,\nsince its only consumer is the imperative widget-registry prefetch effect\nin SidebarContextProvider. The provider gate (topics only for the openedx\nprovider) moves inside queryFn, the model-store bridge learns idField so\nthe discussionTopics model stays keyed by usageKey, and useDispatch\nleaves SidebarContextProvider. The useModel readers are untouched\n(#1977), and courseware/data/thunks.js is deleted.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the sidebar widget prefetch contract no longer receives\ndispatch — the context object is now { courseId, course, queryClient }.\nExternal SIDEBAR_WIDGETS whose prefetch dispatched a Redux thunk must\nfetch via the provided React Query client instead.\n\nCloses #2016\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrZevCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk+QQAGv8kZtzcKEV8pO3d3Brp6Tj\n//uLKPn9k4e4At70GFZPrJRewEeH2zwftc/np3rJiOz5VV9TdFVQecr6LT/kGOFa\nmVbnxZcUV52sU/VbATCZzk/ENOhAj5d6G9NQNZbcyPWPpGNQAMRKR3ftB8Wi/Vxt\nhtHNG8oisN+u1so/RLmxMB+weL+8llXAFv9zQW1Q44Q/ukCiQorsK