oth keep writing the model store, which\nstays the readers'' source of truth until #1977. useDispatch leaves\nCoursewareContainer, and courseware/data/thunks.js is down to\ngetCourseDiscussionTopics (#2016).\n\nCloses #2015\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"170a4be673a224b1ecb062ccd8d3b166e1f8a9d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/170a4be673a224b1ecb062ccd8d3b166e1f8a9d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/7dd75bd39423fea1b6cb0c9e9ccf6fcbb96165cc","verification":{"payload":"tree 170a4be673a224b1ecb062ccd8d3b166e1f8a9d2\nparent 4b88ff86d08e3b1c301b3cd68b363db8a3221f28\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789758971 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789758971 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert saveIntegritySignature + saveSequencePosition to React Query mutations (#2067)\n\nThe last two courseware write thunks become mutations in\ncourseware/data/apiHooks.ts: useSaveSequencePosition keeps the optimistic\nactiveUnitIndex update (rollback via onMutate context) and\nuseSaveIntegritySignature keeps the masquerade skip as a\nresolve-without-request branch. Both keep writing the model store, which\nstays the readers'' source of truth until #1977. useDispatch leaves\nCoursewareContainer, and courseware/data/thunks.js is down to\ngetCourseDiscussionTopics (#2016).\n\nCloses #2015\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrY37CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAD68QAH6FPbFPUk51QUH8r3pmvOC7\nfx9EVi5ri1hrJ9GZgeMTE0WEq4bSZDMZ37mo1RhUblcyzY5YO4WyJ+hkPB+Cc8kl\nLxEOoavj53SyWXy97XZrFeyT7vqL/aCN4BELxCgeIDXuGaLltBsFJcpAoPPxmDyC\nxPUBID3xI8pJMo01OduMTsdGFy8ut4nWLHTDmJZFHMknUpn7+B+ePqjfOBmJuXLA\n0j6mljDw5a67l04uw38xMKZxuRKr/FnknF4pJwMlSMVmGZAoJpCHhCgkf0v6dJ/S\n6Ra6VLPAMfIR8d8ibOL51hsdKAF/oHsnpLEgsG8mkDG3JmJ0p9+rHs9BDS+ZG+C0\nQRSEx1nJheQqYzXG/TVTnV