-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/df9f938ed03c0ba9803444c59a6915bc9ac54dd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:40:06Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:40:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: convert the courseware outline sidebar to React Query (#2064)\n\nThe navigation-sidebar outline (getCourseOutlineStructure) and the\ncompletion-tracking waffle toggles (the last job of fetchCourse) become\nqueries; useCheckBlockCompletion''s completion rollups move from the\nupdateCourseOutlineCompletion reducer to a pure helper applied with\nsetQueryData, and the courseOutlineShouldUpdate refetch flag becomes\ninvalidateQueries. The courseware slice is now down to the fields the\ncontainer teardown (#1976) owns.\n\nCloses #2013\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"089393b7d064320c281dd63b7b523075d21983eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/089393b7d064320c281dd63b7b523075d21983eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/df9f938ed03c0ba9803444c59a6915bc9ac54dd3","verification":{"payload":"tree 089393b7d064320c281dd63b7b523075d21983eb\nparent ffaa25c350c5d8b3c26d3ae69477f41fe155d784\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789756806 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789756806 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert the courseware outline sidebar to React Query (#2064)\n\nThe navigation-sidebar outline (getCourseOutlineStructure) and the\ncompletion-tracking waffle toggles (the last job of fetchCourse) become\nqueries; useCheckBlockCompletion''s completion rollups move from the\nupdateCourseOutlineCompletion reducer to a pure helper applied with\nsetQueryData, and the courseOutlineShouldUpdate refetch flag becomes\ninvalidateQueries. The courseware slice is now down to the fields the\ncontainer teardown (#1976) owns.\n\nCloses #2013\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrYWGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsL8QADti7gvE5afDjFQWldB+/cUM\nrVomEQYbwAUuVKgC/CKdD4yUc89lsxAObq/s+bvDWQvJnnbzyO8hIKYW9zNO6BL2\nO5Yo6QAB05DrSvA5RHoHiWC8R4QKbvkwoT6Umt6jOqzN5Z9BmRKtlMi2/im1B8+R\nbgTER67Dbh60HIVsQsJCFILPymZOgozrRB2miLdJ3uizKc9y3fs/Uk2JHyQvT4PH\nSInstIPWQ+f+hU1GMJs5IPJzGjTrrTcer6JjZJqpDEekPhZNc2Dxp3VnISL5PoTp\nr1mHN88aGBXF91HOX/6PyZu2mdsVtU+FNyWyT9UavOANJeWMsSIbO4dpNQr2SdGZ\nOIDNaK8A7AUQR1hiaoTC78llqYcM5klgINvj176S776l4NkYbLZtvmmrulj/9XoR\nDoVsQIzedwWdUCox0owxVld9IaBneurOAozhkj4dUQKtV4kAuO+VLge8YzjI6RFP\nPR5tOV/kcS7u2TAzMlt8Ayx+hQC6xHw6Mr9aL9euKkRxrd7mIULNWj58thS2B6Wt\n3Cz1J/YDLmorn8dV0Olahk03ZkB8PoMjspCorTbJuZtrlXUMsvAgx7EmxNir4DPn\nacqHqVVf8RaHLDmqM7Y/vFHGaGEyq9fMwofu69nQhibiJ6sATZdoA+ExPwM+SUxI\nB+J00FEAnWvthfaDO35M\n=wN6e\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T18:40:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_event