consumer, converted in the layer below), and remove the Test fetchTab block from\nredux.test.js. Part of #1975; closes #2002.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a200710e828f657b169615f7f50215114f1993b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/9a200710e828f657b169615f7f50215114f1993b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/50df09118fe035043bee2059c4ebf4d7c84b7196","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a200710e828f657b169615f7f50215114f1993b\nparent 09e57e07a1c4a363c2d1a699c34dc90ea3713b15\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1787607942 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787607942 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert the live tab from Redux to React Query (#2006)\n\nSelf-wrap the live tab (LiveTab owns useCourseHomeMeta + a new useLiveTabData,\nrenders TabWithTimer, splits the iframe into a LiveTabContent child). Delete\nfetchLiveTab and the now-orphaned shared fetchTab helper (discussion, its other\nconsumer, converted in the layer below), and remove the Test fetchTab block from\nredux.test.js. Part of #1975; closes #2002.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjLuGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHowQAG4RfydrcbR7N79Ni+LWhOr3\n5oWDzVl/znqLKmsqKvE6Wnvgq7AfAVs1zvIJL7J2JQ1b7ywX1gJ4uDjmTe4Hj9TB\nxhWJ3OPXgVD5UtMdCFNbH6oE6cPlRMOYOg8DOVeDC/SdJupj2aA8NO4W6zjuCrRF\nOgxnFgxkhNoHgbQi7lYITJ6MP1u0dGno0JMKLaQYz7O/OlInZJV7o7doM4kIROhm\naW7XIl1hLp67fvn8osnJ4oOBILD2wFRhL3EHXx4F5nJqCDS8WfJeDKRTsZzbxbFq\nmZfua5hDB4BlJ5pAVfp5KBJWEE+6Y61rHOgwe0iNfGezRNfCbB2prQgSgQ7261DF\nCwzRqn1X2ptm6AcCKy8U4Ue+824jGHSAAaDZPR0Wulit9k25DsdrAOf1ayJBhi2Z\nFjPqjKsouOseUDjzyBNj0kX4fgnY/4tnjM14sfDgKGf2uKbJ9R6EK01U3y3Ktzc5\nrJXmHjgtzg2xp31XEBrk36D91vyxvBTGAgj3RnOMdAAf2PAfczL6SZO/2cTzj5s5\nGD6ZhXQr/W8x3wg4hhenAY6P9GgS6z9x7f1NGdgtR7YmL2xXkLHx4FjoYPJrKLHF\n02l+ZLbmGh1xAgbGV579AmQAeu9tG