,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/09e57e07a1c4a363c2d1a699c34dc90ea3713b15","node_id":"C_kwDOCvycV9oAKDA5ZTU3ZTA3YTFjNGEzNjNjMmQxYTY5OWMzNGRjOTBlYTM3MTNiMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc","sha":"e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc"}],"sha":"09e57e07a1c4a363c2d1a699c34dc90ea3713b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/09e57e07a1c4a363c2d1a699c34dc90ea3713b15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:14:56Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:14:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: convert progress tab from Redux to React Query (#2001)\n\nMake ProgressTab self-wrapping — it owns useCourseHomeMeta + a new\nuseProgressTabData query and renders TabWithTimer itself, mirroring the\ndates- and outline-tab conversions. The body moves into a ProgressTabContent\ncomponent so the reads never run against empty data during the loading phase.\n\nEvery progress-subtree reader — the grade/certificate components, the\nProgressTabGradeBreakdownSlot, ProgressHeader, and ProgressTabContent — stops\ncalling useModel(''progress'') and reads the tab data from useProgressTabData via\na new useProgressData() hook. Their courseId reads move from useContextId() to\nuseParams, since the progress route no longer runs a fetch thunk to populate\nstate.courseHome.courseId.\n\nuseProgressTabData keeps a scoped meta: { modelType: ''progress'' } so the\nmodel-store bridge still feeds the one shared, tab-generic reader that resolves\nto ''progress'' — useAccessExpirationMasqueradeBanner, rendered via\nInstructorToolbar; that reader migrates with the model-store dissolution (#1977,\ntracked in #1999). The fetchProgressTab thunk and the now-dead isProgressTab\nbranch of TabContainer are deleted. The examsData exam-attempts write stays in\nRedux, a separate surface to retire later.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8d82bce3bac6d314701b918cf13c7753aeb2065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/c8d82bce3bac6d314701b918cf13c7753aeb2065"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc","verification":{"payload":"tree c8d82bce3bac6d314701b918cf13c7753aeb2065\nparent 591d116ba0219f55361c509cf33df49e8390e565\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1787339696 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787339696 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert progress tab from Redux to React Query (#2001)\n\nMake ProgressTab self-wrapping — it owns useCourseHomeMeta + a new\nuseProgressTabData query and renders TabWithTimer itself, mirroring the\ndates- and outline-tab conversions. The body moves into a ProgressTabContent\ncomponent so the reads never run against empty data during the loading phase.\n\nEvery progress-subtree reader — the grade/certificate components, the\nProgressTabGradeBreakdownSlot, ProgressHeader, and ProgressTabContent — stops\ncalling useModel(''progress'') and reads the tab data from useProgressTabData via\na new useProgressData() hook. Their courseId reads move from useContextId() to\nuseParams, since the progress route no longer runs a fetch thunk to populate\nstate.courseHome.courseId.\n\nuseProgressTabData keeps a scoped meta: { modelType: ''progress'' } so the\nmodel-store bridge still feeds the one shared, tab-generic reader that resolves\nto ''progress'' — useAccessExpirationMasqueradeBanner, rendered via\nInstructorToolbar; that reader migrates with the model-store dissolution (#1977,\ntracked in #1999). The fetchProgressTab thunk and the now-dead isProgressTab\nbranch of TabContainer are deleted. The examsData exam-attempts write stays in\nRedux, a separate surface to retire later.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiKOwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGwkQAEY5gvc7xKefQyNcz+pmnRkz\nWgssHr3EFfvoeD0+VbAGRLjrP8i1wMJEMeuugWj9TSw/LnglVO40+HGTXbN9qhSg\nKSYk6X92ARa1T1SJYktXq757IMh5SuWOqdh5oSdJ5YFXZyA1JJUHnwxLHBWzkmYM\nDSLBSWRhD0meiUCcAkdmuz0u0/Ss/3tN9gBBYXgi95K04ggKnQfHrvRbmVsq20Ty\nsOy0Ish8LLFFL4XiL0RJfZXTyUztiPCoyo3aJOGeFDWYB9S78CEjgyKxfJWX/9Yt\nJ9VL4tH9FyNV91WguZJczM36whJME8hoVJNEQaseBgSMdjjq84e5wHaOe7IFf6Xx\nH5y8XdnWycDpdQ5E5/6gKtdLpmP+qEzvKatqdHkF4vcad83dvmYpXIfx5vW9p9mx\njh456NXQ5+z9nqc2NUoUzXlLBpGSjJVY2C9uRTBypQ9HueA5P6U6c264CHxPGJQ0\n3yUo199Iuwqe68YyjmcgND5h6pCu6sAaFhAf5uFGKh2DxUvgvtPGy2UAMPgPyedN\nKJmbq+0Y855WmM6hhQqJK6A+kWXNz7OJAScNQJ8JtKIYtbm3yQlym9LplGsaHTUL\npGSIw3fUzKpX0W1rvDxGKGEKScI2zlG7P7uN9Jm62zD8sVFz/L3v/pqnWj5//FoZ\n+fsDRdlo6E+YJegBPRNf\n=Ckpj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-21T19:14:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc","node_id":"C_kwDOCvycV9oAKGUwODUxOTg2MTgyNTk2YjU4MzQxYzhiNTAxNjU0OTYzYzgyNjJkZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/591d116ba0219f55361c509cf33df49e8390e565","sha":"591d116ba0219f55361c509cf33df49e8390e565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/591d116ba0219f55361c509cf33df49e8390e565"}],"sha":"e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/e0851986182596b58341c8b501654963c8262ddc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/591d116ba0219f55361c509cf33df49e8390e565/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:04:56Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:04:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: convert outline tab from Redux to React Query (#1997)\n\nMake OutlineTab self-wrapping — it owns useCourseHomeMeta + a new\nuseOutlineTabData query and renders TabWithTimer itself, mirroring the\ndates-tab conversion. The heavy body moves into an OutlineTabContent\ncomponent so the useModel(''outline'') reads never run against the empty\nmodel during the loading phase.\n\nSubtree courseId reads move from the courseHome slice (directly, or via\nuseContextId in section-outline) to useParams, since the outline route\nno longer runs a fetch thunk to populate state.courseHome.courseId.\n\nShiftDatesAlert now invalidates both datesTab and outlineTab and drops\nits fetch/useDispatch. The outline-only POST writers dismissWelcomeMessage\nand saveWeeklyLearningGoal become useDismissWelcomeMessage /\nuseSaveWeeklyLearningGoal mutations, and the fetchOutlineTab thunk is\ndeleted. proctoringPanelStatus stays in Redux (client UI state).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66570340346f3dea209dcee770cc535835ea8ef4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/66570340346f3dea209dcee770cc535835ea8ef4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/591d116ba0219f55361c509cf33df49e8390e565","verification":{"payload":"tree 66570340346f3dea209dcee770cc535835ea8ef4\nparent 5fe995a9f42da5e9d14b444c4009ec8aac83d2f9\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1787339096 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787339096 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert outline tab from Redux to React Query (#1997)\n\nMake OutlineTab self-wrapping — it owns useCourseHomeMeta + a new\nuseOutlineTabData query and renders TabWithTimer itself, mirroring the\ndates-tab conversion. The heavy body moves into an OutlineTabContent\ncomponent so the useModel(''outline'') reads never run against the empty\nmodel during the loading phase.\n\nSubtree courseId reads move from the courseHome slice (directly, or via\nuseContextId in section-outline) to useParams, since the outline route\nno longer runs a fetch thunk to populate state.courseHome.courseId.\n\nShiftDatesAlert now invalidates both datesTab and outlineTab and drops\nits fetch/useDispatch. The outline-only POST writers dismissWelcomeMessage\nand saveWeeklyLearningGoal become useDismissWelcomeMessage /\nuseSaveWeeklyLearningGoal mutations, and the fetchOutlineTab thunk is\ndeleted. proctoringPanelStatus stays in Redux (client UI state).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiKFYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS4MQABSbqgrD37aNQoxpe1Rm0e3d\nUrwP4b5DCIRWAkZe69BSg+x+Riiqu0nDWR9hpxUDQxg+pOebX+Da9dQGwGtGAaRY\nVBV7GuDD2rhwaLrwsL+5L3T4QySn8MVQlIoErZgLnOXpFYM672QejGTSYnDm/RTZ\n0r9zjnbZqSyhShyKnO/oVDV1AM1GyXmZ3k3FBuHAQKexii1WtuOMKpiiviE1ccjy\nMFh3tlmDQyvRAXQledOK7XCvRrKOgdf0HdhI6BC/MX3i6fpVLJBDCr3BvjCW7Sfu\nPq6OaN53tbT2Kf8ar2tNTrOkmLH4kgk4Vtqa9Wi3FxAQjtK8dDtphP2BrJ+9TCb+\nkWCShiJnz7wLinA9XG+C9WG2aZqgufXBJ3eO5K11fN+WfbkP4JpGYjIMtLxTBhXJ\niyBNIU/h5hPUKJCAIf8K8bFDI+fdP5eYwz3OIcwDbyENyujWquzn8lHS4NyQ8S3P\nf5V8pNEsSUByDoQcuOn+GW2edlF3JxGXVLsM4VoCPgQZeGgqnbadlih7g32R4bNF\nUdHUwpoLQwbKSa27bblGY/JiZMrSxErLKsYgp1JoO6spliatWRMAYO6pToGhoF0h\ncJHWGotYvItaQS8ONhukgWNEZVgCwCYLtkMA69XN6ZBUKSoaU9EtyFaGR9OnYU3f\n7VcVd6zmF4cYY6e4SegB\n=z8Si\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-21T19:04:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","rep