#1993)\n\nRemove the vestigial `metadataModel` prop from the shared TabPage. Its only live\neffect was gating the screen-reader-only launch-tour button, which is only ever\nreal on the outline tab — gate that on `activeTabSlug === ''outline''` instead and\nrename the helper to `renderSrOnlyTourButton`. Drop `metadataModel` from\nLoadedTabPage and its dead pass-through to StreakCelebrationModal, and from the\nDatesTab / CoursewareContainer / TabContainer call sites. Move\nLaunchCourseHomeTourButton''s `courseId` from the Redux slice to `useParams`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afdf5bfe67345c1ba0aa0c4c0d7a5983c8a4883c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/afdf5bfe67345c1ba0aa0c4c0d7a5983c8a4883c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/db3808c29377af4a61484940a6248644e38da83c","verification":{"payload":"tree afdf5bfe67345c1ba0aa0c4c0d7a5983c8a4883c\nparent d6d9a6192672cd72feb10326feddfbc73bce60c7\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1787337640 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787337640 -0400\n\nrefactor: simplify the course-home tour button (#1993)\n\nRemove the vestigial `metadataModel` prop from the shared TabPage. Its only live\neffect was gating the screen-reader-only launch-tour button, which is only ever\nreal on the outline tab — gate that on `activeTabSlug === ''outline''` instead and\nrename the helper to `renderSrOnlyTourButton`. Drop `metadataModel` from\nLoadedTabPage and its dead pass-through to StreakCelebrationModal, and from the\nDatesTab / CoursewareContainer / TabContainer call sites. Move\nLaunchCourseHomeTourButton''s `courseId` from the Redux slice to `useParams`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiJuoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVVUQAGWaltAYdk7zXrK2MoNyX0Zf\nTHEyWMcA8pJGsG18b7Q5Z50K3s