bce60c7","sha":"d6d9a6192672cd72feb10326feddfbc73bce60c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/d6d9a6192672cd72feb10326feddfbc73bce60c7"}],"sha":"db3808c29377af4a61484940a6248644e38da83c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/db3808c29377af4a61484940a6248644e38da83c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/d6d9a6192672cd72feb10326feddfbc73bce60c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T18:34:38Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T18:34:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: convert the dates tab to React Query (#1987)\n\nConvert the dates tab off Redux thunks to React Query. The tab becomes\nself-wrapping: it renders TabPage itself and owns its data loading via query\nhooks.\n\n- DatesTab renders TabWithTimer and owns its data via useCourseHomeMeta +\n  useDatesTabData; courseId comes from useParams.\n- TabPage: courseStatus becomes a union (StatusValue | { metadataQuery,\n  tabDataQuery }); a converted tab passes its queries and TabPage derives the\n  view (loading/error/denied/loaded), reading access from the metadata query,\n  and gating on isPending (not isLoading, which is false for a disabled/paused\n  query and would misread \"not loaded yet\" as denied).\n  Builds on the TabPage TypeScript conversion in the layer below (#1986).\n- TabWithTimer wraps TabPage with OuterExamTimer, keeping\n  @edx/frontend-lib-special-exams out of the shared TabPage; TabContainer uses\n  it, CoursewareContainer keeps rendering plain TabPage.\n- ShiftDatesAlert invalidates the dates query on reset; its fetch prop is now\n  optional (the still-Redux outline tab''s transitional refresh). The dates\n  subtree reads courseId from useParams.\n- The app QueryCache is built in a new src/queryClient.ts: onError reports query\n  failures via logError, and onSuccess runs the transitional model-store bridge\n  (bridgeToModelStore in data/modelStoreBridge) that mirrors results into\n  existing useModel readers until the store is removed. index.jsx and\n  createTestQueryClient use it.\n- Drop the now-unused fetchDatesTab thunk and its re-export.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3fdb25015fa300d30d225c9a621de684ef7a7580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/3fdb25015fa300d30d225c9a621de684ef7a7580"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/d6d9a6192672cd72feb10326feddfbc73bce60c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fdb25015fa300d30d225c9a621de684ef7a7580\nparent 17246007de5e328d6f5fb271e2a9bd7022b6c01b\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1787337278 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787337278 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert the dates tab to React Query (#1987)\n\nConvert the dates tab off Redux thunks to React Query. The tab becomes\nself-wrapping: it renders TabPage itself and owns its data loading via query\nhooks.\n\n- DatesTab renders TabWithTimer and owns its data via useCourseHomeMeta +\n  useDatesTabData; courseId comes from useParams.\n- TabPage: courseStatus becomes a union (StatusValue | { metadataQuery,\n  tabDataQuery }); a converted tab passes its queries and TabPage derives the\n  view (loading/error/denied/loaded), reading access from the metadata query,\n  and gating on isPending (not isLoading, which is false for a disabled/paused\n  query and would misread \"not loaded yet\" as denied).\n  Builds on the TabPage TypeScript conversion in the layer below (#1986).\n- TabWithTimer wraps TabPage with OuterExamTimer, keeping\n  @edx/frontend-lib-special-exams out of the shared TabPage; TabContainer uses\n  it, CoursewareContainer keeps rendering plain TabPage.\n- ShiftDatesAlert invalidates the dates query on reset; its fetch prop is now\n  optional (the still-Redux outline tab''s transitional refresh). The dates\n  subtree reads courseId from useParams.\n- The app QueryCache is built in a new src/queryClient.ts: onError reports query\n  failures via logError, and onSuccess runs the transitional model-store bridge\n  (bridgeToModelStore in data/modelStoreBridge) that mirrors results into\n  existing useModel readers until the store is removed. index.jsx and\n  createTestQueryClient use it.\n- Drop the now-unused fetchDatesTab thunk and its re-export.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiJo+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHzQQACR/EXEQgHIbizuzA6cHaLXG\ngm/iQAbdQgh3csoMgjsREAjmOTmUBdt9AYgCrClpRBnliL/cyh9YrvEv/l6mp9zD\nNGPD8l8fZCZP1tGeA1WdQqKj9YA97rxLhV9v4aQAeCA2/pa2ayTZS7bfOnK4aoEj\n9tjTBoqeABdaV5xPPIG4ooDya6ArVzxBCyITtrPjHamRlyvEdK/dIMKdaULNdger\nW+qX+/ZRGbCTOjs+p63iIDI1eKlHoKhQXlFOl