ig from local.openedx.io:8000 instead of localhost:8000\nkeeps the LMS, Studio, and MFEs under one *.local.openedx.io domain, which\navoids localhost-specific CORS/cookie carve-outs and better matches a\nproduction setup.\n\nWorks with Tutor dev (whose default LMS host is local.openedx.io) and with\nthe upcoming openedx-platform bare-metal development.py config.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9fbe4ead04f510eab4505de64b153e575c77440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/d9fbe4ead04f510eab4505de64b153e575c77440"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/95668319cf868ea6770875e2b4899ce910a5f473","verification":{"payload":"tree d9fbe4ead04f510eab4505de64b153e575c77440\nparent 3b045cc3482b5e176ae76e7ece51c66d8e16f817\nauthor Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1786383563 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786383563 -0400\n\nbuild: Default the dev MFE config API URL to local.openedx.io (#1981)\n\nFetching MFE config from local.openedx.io:8000 instead of localhost:8000\nkeeps the LMS, Studio, and MFEs under one *.local.openedx.io domain, which\navoids localhost-specific CORS/cookie carve-outs and better matches a\nproduction setup.\n\nWorks with Tutor dev (whose default LMS host is local.openedx.io) and with\nthe upcoming openedx-platform bare-metal development.py config.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqegzLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl2YQABpSHS2frAd9z+fj8XpRLfHY\nVNFh58Q8wy03utBOtn3HKEnodDZS2OeA4W8DGN1aGf3ee/unPvpr167/TswiMkzw\nv5yiC5OS5xevQ7WIf74+IPDUnqOXf569E2ZGfVtdexP2Al1ZoeseOmuQn1IhlV4n\nX7dn9yyFmnr8vySCs/LrHzLGUtpbLBa/D7mfENXClsQNbVkaxG+IWouMgNO0Jeto\nOO5aT9BTvt7jT5Y90WX6kHZSy+qSrgD+OEJhyaxBpAOZUTNWNty2dlecN93aNbIm\nzfZpcJZJm7V+2fB1GzcmwWlI6Xr4/J+RZQBbgcD5L8OZeZAopI9Rt8ijrDRUjrFd\nuk1yMZyGr6WqLsik/Nj5DMp8tVwdKUKC001B79PSuVXwAuvj5TPzZW2USk4OKFdP\nNb