an-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/49b102afc05e6d312a28276e8a4ea203de77c99b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:16:26Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:16:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: convert course recommendations to React Query (#1967)\n\nReplace the Redux `recommendations` slice + thunk with a\n`useCourseRecommendations` React Query hook, as the pattern-setter for the\nwider Redux -> React Query migration (#1946).\n\n- Add the app-level QueryClient/QueryClientProvider (bare, matching the\n  frontend-base shell) and a QueryClientProvider wrapper in the test render.\n- Add a colocated data layer: data/queryKeys.ts (rooted at a new `appId`\n  constant) + data/apiHooks.ts (useQuery over the existing getCourseRecommendations).\n- Delete data/slice.js and data/thunks.js; CourseExit now calls\n  postUnsubscribeFromGoalReminders directly from data/api.js.\n- Remove the `recommendations` reducer from the store and the test store.\n- CourseRecommendations branches on React Query flags (isPending/isError/\n  isSuccess) instead of a status string; the tracking event moves to a\n  colocated track.js. Behavior is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e352a74e55a0d7ccd9aeeced77b7f959faabe83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/9e352a74e55a0d7ccd9aeeced77b7f959faabe83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/49b102afc05e6d312a28276e8a4ea203de77c99b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e352a74e55a0d7ccd9aeeced77b7f959faabe83\nparent db2134c94f2a8dbc52b6962e44bc5accdb8d52de\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1786083386 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786083386 -0400\n\nrefactor: convert course recommendations to React Query (#1967)\n\nReplace the Redux `recommendations` slice + thunk with a\n`useCourseRecommendations` React Query hook, as the pattern-setter for the\nwider Redux -> React Query migration (#1946).\n\n- Add the app-level QueryClient/QueryClientProvider (bare, matching the\n  frontend-base shell) and a QueryClientProvider wrapper in the test render.\n- Add a colocated data layer: data/queryKeys.ts (rooted at a new `appId`\n  constant) + data/apiHooks.ts (useQuery over the existing getCourseRecommendations).\n- Delete data/slice.js and data/thunks.js; CourseExit now calls\n  postUnsubscribeFromGoalReminders directly from data/api.js.\n- Remove the `recommendations` reducer from the store and the test store.\n- CourseRecommendations branches on React Query flags (isPending/isError/\n  isSuccess) instead of a status string; the tracking event moves to a\n  colocated track.js. Behavior is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdXg6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABdIQAEIM7wfuxq9GcXrvvK/pc9mt\naSSL31NjoNqzUcbP/KXrZxiPHhFFMXnuSP16to/uqmtEYzJ/c8+WXOoR9KBPG5pP\nTZFf6xdh+oaq1F5naypbo+YRxt3pVDqoeSqxoS7OmqD7rfJjBEvY1Ow2j2ba5Gj4\n/Mwp7FJ2Z0W10+tOHLWflTV3U6xTe8p+7XmHfK/OEOMyQs/3o53g/CU5ifH8kolu\nevpUYcB94T66Hczemo1etnoWF3jucHANYfi2vb06wr15qL4IeXE8q2SEmpE+cKEQ\njQdTRBpxIKSiuxBRw/zNUNfDqUFmyLOk6HbOBVB7ajajuCLbHMZ6EAIVVcqfwIww\nVubS3egso04ig/uEhcG5Pqw5hZds1sLALTaEmRVm7RU8nxA/uH9OJ07tNi4kcFvS\nBBYWdpZa0tddcXrRF/rXXkZVVTfbPwXIprfz7RSMw23gcYNUzWGL6hNz9xzG6s32\nzl/+HmGSuHsRNX4YutUYoVdVXSNpM4mYiyFc3Afjm52i157jfTW+sjGErn7IPCDg\nBijHrOu7gbpDY1fWaf6jx