.github.com/users/xitij2000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xitij2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xitij2000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xitij2000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commits/8eb7cca57315a0b77960f882e34f9068a20312bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:27:12Z","email":"kshitij@sobti.in","name":"Kshitij Sobti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:27:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add new slots for customizing course outline section and sequence completion icons (#1933)\n\n* feat: Add new slots for customizing course outline section and sequence completion icons\n\nIntroduces `CourseOutlineSidebarSectionCompletionIconSlot` and `CourseOutlineSidebarSequenceCompletionIconSlot` to enable customization, modification, or replacement of completion icons in the course outline. Updated components to integrate with these new slots.\n\n* fixup! feat: Add new slots for customizing course outline section and sequence completion icons\n\n* feat: Add `active` prop to completion icon slots\n\nUpdated `CourseOutlineSidebarSectionCompletionIconSlot` and `CourseOutlineSidebarSequenceCompletionIconSlot` to include an `active` prop, enabling styling based on the active state of sections or sequences.\n\n* refactor: Consolidate section and sequence completion icon slots\n\nCombined `CourseOutlineSidebarSectionCompletionIconSlot` and `CourseOutlineSidebarSequenceCompletionIconSlot` into a single `CourseOutlineSidebarCompletionIconSlot` to simplify implementation. Updated components to use the `variant` prop for distinguishing between sections and sequences.docs: Add README for `CourseOutlineSidebarCompletionIconSlot`\n\nIntroduced documentation for the consolidated `CourseOutlineSidebarCompletionIconSlot`, including usage examples for customizing section and sequence completion icons.\n\n* fix: apply review feedback","tree":{"sha":"12afbe37cd1a2b8606a8e51bb3ba4c3e00239b1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/12afbe37cd1a2b8606a8e51bb3ba4c3e00239b1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/8eb7cca57315a0b77960f882e34f9068a20312bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 12afbe37cd1a2b8606a8e51bb3ba4c3e00239b1e\nparent f34f95e5bce5ea54c7fd12d6c8a9dc2e7f6033ba\nauthor Kshitij Sobti <kshitij@sobti.in> 1784298432 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784298432 -0400\n\nfeat: Add new slots for customizing course outline section and sequence completion icons (#1933)\n\n* feat: Add new slots for customizing course outline section and sequence completion icons\n\nIntroduces `CourseOutlineSidebarSectionCompletionIconSlot` and `CourseOutlineSidebarSequenceCompletionIconSlot` to enable customization, modification, or replacement of completion icons in the course outline. Updated components to integrate with these new slots.\n\n* fixup! feat: Add new slots for customizing course outline section and sequence completion icons\n\n* feat: Add `active` prop to completion icon slots\n\nUpdated `CourseOutlineSidebarSectionCompletionIconSlot` and `CourseOutlineSidebarSequenceCompletionIconSlot` to include an `active` prop, enabling styling based on the active state of sections or sequences.\n\n* refactor: Consolidate section and sequence completion icon slots\n\nCombined `CourseOutlineSidebarSectionCompletionIconSlot` and `CourseOutlineSidebarSequenceCompletionIconSlot` into a single `CourseOutlineSidebarCompletionIconSlot` to simplify implementation. Updated components to use the `variant` prop for distinguishing between sections and sequences.docs: Add README for `CourseOutlineSidebarCompletionIconSlot`\n\nIntroduced documentation for the consolidated `CourseOutlineSidebarCompletionIconSlot`, including usage examples for customizing section and sequence completion icons.\n\n* fix: apply review feedback","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWjvACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9N4QABKA3c3WZubC57mb0MHXNUMw\nCX7F9dTh9zUZnxnpYh/g+aUCq1DCWeWeamz/miDCJA3ekq8w3H330x7BdkLupFMW\nBWggGPleo8LD1TpmyHhTaP9XQOuyBDaAirwM4/VVUbwvXO1HSCdHq10UIK84RIvK\nU2cEVyL7QBcwCzvf6MV8zf9a8urk6pAi/tVXNadHxqroyLIml920FsxKeGlKh2O7\nqHNNfrTXCcR9E7Itgmw166vRoWwojUfaizumfaPa7CpAdfzytYxlg++YEC3tUMwl\nAfJx0TpppEi0nQHl50Ny4vPkWQWaQ9T8L1GN6JZUsk3tLiJ4oxBW36tESyElLErF\nssSakfsbebaBPNW5vPFZ/DZaNgVS4bXOxzUZf9hzcK8RllExylpJIe4QvMn8tjrs\nbHQ3y+8Fh9L/uVVe3JvCzNYDgCm1MfB5t7WNNfEOql9jpSdy2bkI5E3czzyXkaWG\nWp5/kOY4t+UEIWbK+1bHSXD5XPjn5gQDi3FZphCJs3Yj481egE0MXatAOkclhEEc\nX11cnfrwT5kDeYK5J9FQ3hC4W99rtz6GAKR/nQDFp2bW5gH9MKaCCIBTYogwyNne\n2QZQWPjLZq4rRug49GazTIKq9ofwp8y/TFx9BMTccX7oLQSOZWmsl1ZJWVFW553t\nZAIi3sssQS5gm2lk0S6Z\n=cHQ6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T14:27:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/commit/8