"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanbsmith/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanbsmith/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alanbsmith","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Workday/canvas-kit/commit/ffa1c89206ffb225fa448438cb813bc29418c817","node_id":"C_kwDOCwpuNtoAKGZmYTFjODkyMDZmZmIyMjVmYTQ0ODQzOGNiODEzYmMyOTQxOGM4MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Workday/canvas-kit/commit/ad3e316566362c819d1d364ef4478a6d0f1ba02d","sha":"ad3e316566362c819d1d364ef4478a6d0f1ba02d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/ad3e316566362c819d1d364ef4478a6d0f1ba02d"}],"sha":"ffa1c89206ffb225fa448438cb813bc29418c817","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/ffa1c89206ffb225fa448438cb813bc29418c817"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182549198?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olaonikosi","id":182549198,"login":"olaonikosi","node_id":"U_kgDOCuF6zg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/ad3e316566362c819d1d364ef4478a6d0f1ba02d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:32:32Z","email":"onikosi.ola1@gmail.com","name":"olaonikosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:32:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(skills): Add contribute-component maintainer skill (#4195)\n\nAdds a maintainer skill for contributing components to Canvas Kit, and aligns AGENTS.md / related skills with current focus, stencil, and collection guidance.\n\nThe contribute skill captures the process used to build SelectionGroup (#1969): gathering the spec from GitHub and Figma, choosing sibling components to copy, extending the collection system when appropriate, the Sana styling checklist, tests, and a PR summary template.\n\nAlso updates maintainer guidance so agents do not teach removed patterns (`data-whatinput` / `InputProvider`), do not repeat `boxSizing: ''border-box''` inside `createStencil` (already injected), and know when to extend `@workday/canvas-kit-react/collection` vs a plain `createModelHook`.\n\n[category:Documentation]\n\nCo-authored-by: Ola Onikosi <michael.onikosi@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: manuel.carrera <manuel.carrera@workday.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc7b0211821a9649ed0de0ae4c504e21a04597cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/trees/bc7b0211821a9649ed0de0ae4c504e21a04597cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/commits/ad3e316566362c819d1d364ef4478a6d0f1ba02d","verification":{"payload":"tree bc7b0211821a9649ed0de0ae4c504e21a04597cc\nparent 7d7b082072832ef2487df44d41d9463b0c6053e1\nauthor olaonikosi <onikosi.ola1@gmail.com> 1791217952 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791217952 -0600\n\nchore(skills): Add contribute-component maintainer skill (#4195)\n\nAdds a maintainer skill for contributing components to Canvas Kit, and aligns AGENTS.md / related skills with current focus, stencil, and collection guidance.\n\nThe contribute skill captures the process used to build SelectionGroup (#1969): gathering the spec from GitHub and Figma, choosing sibling components to copy, extending the collection system when appropriate, the Sana styling checklist, tests, and a PR summary template.\n\nAlso updates maintainer guidance so agents do not teach removed patterns (`data-whatinput` / `InputProvider`), do not repeat `boxSizing: ''border-box''` inside `createStencil` (already injected), and know when to extend `@workday/canvas-kit-react/collection` vs a plain `createModelHook`.\n\n[category:Documentation]\n\nCo-authored-by: Ola Onikosi <michael.onikosi@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: manuel.carrera <manuel.carrera@workday.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9EgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxMUQAAPh+1FOu8yrQiKu63EFn/st\n9FYt0KKOELi+BFSn50cmEK6CvigrTUsDu8VRBH1IewCdPUG0+qEEfYhPXpf2BPq7\njcMUWBBsRZ8TD5jSJO1qrYQ2eBSYkJ5/wJFFeMzu/CA61AUZetxVHo6ueEoW5lPg\nbytIetZd68FaQMjHa71aUwZoLdyME6b4AwyoX5pUV49JQex0rokBSz8IREiMoocq\nNLos78urDhmk0Izdn7ZDC3x8LaW/oVaB+fSDQky6KtXWdqyMf7FLaP+hJn/Nl1Yj\nC8Y3Iy31y8eW3aUG6+dAspdiIwM+HfzkI1We7aQk0DJqx1NX6FvksAoOY36iqOJz\nUh7F4ykeK0NYce3GAXSWHqZVtoZvl78fBWJZXnpyjdfMymUNkzV/3OyJDDk8mzu7\npYOUAYvyFLr419Gg/Wn0N/22+ZNhwcQuYTUr2l4MfZreKZOdIBENxKR8oOu65ke8\nf6uBjwKIWMARKjbT3SjvWoeiZx7lxhd3h77/l9AKBSNtmoo5+ieNk+6bIlA5d4/Z\n9ejDf5n7GdoDXnEYQIBJJ32UZfXQaWYgRjWOrHREg1cv5MT2jzYUkn4papvI4DMu\nEas4J1E5IQrisVoRoSXEa8KjnEV2pPydXSTJZ9AVYFK/1VIcXE8ZXNjE8UfSUT0v\nHR16qcp8B/+ZBP3UYhWl\n=Qrs7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T16:32:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":1