0ODdkZjQ0ZDQxZDk0NjNiMGM2MDUzZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Workday/canvas-kit/commit/e552df46a2348d552ffd8442068a5ccf4e7a793e","sha":"e552df46a2348d552ffd8442068a5ccf4e7a793e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/e552df46a2348d552ffd8442068a5ccf4e7a793e"}],"sha":"7d7b082072832ef2487df44d41d9463b0c6053e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/7d7b082072832ef2487df44d41d9463b0c6053e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286109917?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/purvas12","id":286109917,"login":"purvas12","node_id":"U_kgDOEQ2w3Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purvas12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/e552df46a2348d552ffd8442068a5ccf4e7a793e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:58:54Z","email":"purva.sane@workday.com","name":"purvas12"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:58:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(action-bar): Expand accessibility section for AI codegen (#4189)\n\nResolves: N/A (docs initiative: accessibility guidance for AI codegen)\n\nRewrites the `## Accessibility` section of `ActionBar.mdx` to follow the pattern used by the Button and Menu docs: intro and related-component links, minimum accessible structure, built-in behaviors (including overflow, keyboard, and screen reader expectations), an accessibility requirements table with a \"no design spec\" default and REQUIRED/CONDITIONAL summary, and anti-patterns. Every ARIA/focus claim was checked against `modules/react/action-bar/lib` and the Menu/collection hooks. The Open/close focus table is omitted because Action Bar is not an overlay.\n\nAlso adds a small Storybook docs style (`.storybook/preview-head.html`) that makes plain MDX table cells opaque. Storybook''s zebra striping used the same color as inline `code`, so code pills were indistinguishable in the new requirements table. The Component API tables already had opaque cells, so this makes the MDX tables consistent with them.\n\n[category:Documentation]\n\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: @claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f79189656e154a03f3acd88e2d2cee918660e646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/trees/f79189656e154a03f3acd88e2d2cee918660e646"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/commits/e552df46a2348d552ffd8442068a5ccf4e7a793e","verification":{"payload":"tree f79189656e154a03f3acd88e2d2cee918660e646\nparent fb819e7a6ff67a1f97b18a6c987a603fb06c2223\nauthor purvas12 <purva.sane@workday.com> 1791215934 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791215934 -0600\n\ndocs(action-bar): Expand accessibility section for AI codegen (#4189)\n\nResolves: N/A (docs initiative: accessibility guidance for AI codegen)\n\nRewrites the `## Accessibility` section of `ActionBar.mdx` to follow the pattern used by the Button and Menu docs: intro and related-component links, minimum accessible structure, built-in behaviors (including overflow, keyboard, and screen reader expectations), an accessibility requirements table with a \"no design spec\" default and REQUIRED/CONDITIONAL summary, and anti-patterns. Every ARIA/focus claim was checked against `modules/react/action-bar/lib` and the Menu/collection hooks. The Open/close focus table is omitted because Action Bar is not an overlay.\n\nAlso adds a small Storybook docs style (`.storybook/preview-head.html`) that makes plain MDX table cells opaque. Storybook''s zebra striping used the same color as inline `code`, so code pills were indistinguishable in the new requirements table. The Component API tables already had opaque cells, so this makes the MDX tables consistent with them.\n\n[category:Documentation]\n\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: @claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw8k+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA87EQALFzUW7vtqO6nY4KpJ+0c5HP\n3aWjOChMMWrvJK2UknbGyN21OcUvLmyuNPpdyzUkvzESOdLDMydSIvZS3RXnNASx\nQ2g8gkogHFnEP7cFF8vmtQZ/TnfHXOY6vqGngPneX4RUCTjXbjZ+SHa5wG/9OxGp\nU+//Qduaqu5HRwcqcGGf5aFGCasif3lGitgNxgK2ogpV4pIMNKg+nd6OU3lFqzcR\nl7pJZcKqfycJ/Mdc7dsQQU6RbYr6xS2GHgdUq4eOGsz1hSt1Y0xA3Ny5+/0Ltwlx\nviG3p7gFXNlFfhthUJiE1F+ZhQLXufalP4eSphkHYSW4WYpdDAYBCAnhg0RPWJC6\nHs0J55VSfVueB/x0Tvanxn8tqBm+t/Pcb+tNExPrTENPSvFWtZb3HA4+aOBQrBhY\nvEYT1oVDb905Ez9qpJZ62udEW+kdfY4zF6tSXUj4wv8vdticsNoeeX3c3D1solqL\nvDzdrw6YdECtb0fR3TzaEhHDKT5U0BqN1OEhxk1DY9zvOGseaCzjDsT7fduwzTIa\nFD326KiW3cEHJwEd7ohMnXmYAFYOszcTxYDuRWrl8xOy5o5V3+tvCjto0oI0VaBg\nYl6J8BonTx+JIBTIkrf63qLsSL9hYoJ2AStvlnooFtZWHQOv8uFe7ASzbh94YFfr\n0r81r4ig2Przbhdj9fXG\n=VC9W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T15:58:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login"