E2MDNmYjA2YzIyMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Workday/canvas-kit/commit/0b6cabfe1afbe122bc8f279da1764d3ba07f8e16","sha":"0b6cabfe1afbe122bc8f279da1764d3ba07f8e16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/0b6cabfe1afbe122bc8f279da1764d3ba07f8e16"}],"sha":"fb819e7a6ff67a1f97b18a6c987a603fb06c2223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/fb819e7a6ff67a1f97b18a6c987a603fb06c2223"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40372497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/williamjstanton","id":40372497,"login":"williamjstanton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzcyNDk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/0b6cabfe1afbe122bc8f279da1764d3ba07f8e16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:59:10Z","email":"40372497+williamjstanton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"William Stanton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:59:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(ToolbarIconButton): Add a text formatting toolbar example (#4185)\n\nFixes #2884\n\nReplace the inline Toolbar stories with a Text Formatting toolbar example. The example composes `ToolbarIconButton`, `Select`, `Tooltip`, and `Dialog` inside a `role=\"toolbar\"` group that uses the collection system for roving tabindex.\n\nThe toolbar includes a Text Style select (Normal Text, Heading 1, Heading 2, Heading 3), Bold, Italic, and Underline toggles, and an Insert Link button that opens a non-modal dialog with Link Text and URL fields. Tooltip titles supply each control''s accessible name. Arrow keys move between controls and stop at the ends. Toolbar arrow keys do not run while the Text Style menu is open.\n\nA Storybook docs page describes the composition, and the story is tagged `autodocs` so that page renders.\n\n[category:Documentation]\n\nCo-authored-by: William Stanton <william.stanton@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e59efd206d259f22df6c66f2614172ecad097d28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/trees/e59efd206d259f22df6c66f2614172ecad097d28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/commits/0b6cabfe1afbe122bc8f279da1764d3ba07f8e16","verification":{"payload":"tree e59efd206d259f22df6c66f2614172ecad097d28\nparent 431b7a4d30f20e2b836e1db1a7edcab005308f30\nauthor William Stanton <40372497+williamjstanton@users.noreply.github.com> 1790953150 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790953150 -0600\n\ndocs(ToolbarIconButton): Add a text formatting toolbar example (#4185)\n\nFixes #2884\n\nReplace the inline Toolbar stories with a Text Formatting toolbar example. The example composes `ToolbarIconButton`, `Select`, `Tooltip`, and `Dialog` inside a `role=\"toolbar\"` group that uses the collection system for roving tabindex.\n\nThe toolbar includes a Text Style select (Normal Text, Heading 1, Heading 2, Heading 3), Bold, Italic, and Underline toggles, and an Insert Link button that opens a non-modal dialog with Link Text and URL fields. Tooltip titles supply each control''s accessible name. Arrow keys move between controls and stop at the ends. Toolbar arrow keys do not run while the Text Style menu is open.\n\nA Storybook docs page describes the composition, and the story is tagged `autodocs` so that page renders.\n\n[category:Documentation]\n\nCo-authored-by: William Stanton <william.stanton@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv8a+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANS8QAFFRtkx3SP2uS37KRJdqcf7k\nd7bFd2USU2xMox2cdo77I70eWPdsGsarS5OD8QPgVmEFD38JvOKwBcGYN9NhR+QC\n0CTGThMJRdvIyJMYNMAu9HKl8m9VtcjxWxsGSloyjDhMVIfssTxgcF/PgoB6Zr8Y\nNdHkxDCa4G42ZhpyFlwd0pIV4Z/hOd+hGS2J2QpszYQasPacaiLBz1k06XB8y8ZE\nqgzno2walXuMA3Kxw6oEh9kg1Quc/gDqk4SGQMhBQRD5Xm2N1gNPaloUkZeydRN9\nSWVzSbARsR5sHyvPEIFptUY8DSXRRgy3MieyGLrkjlPSOe+HskX/Ilrd/28nnssn\nKsGWYUzFPyZAQ7tfdAb5CvqEYlQhf7K3nk0+2+JtEbXouMYVYWMLsyhZxLEHSeOu\n3Q8JnIOHkJdPrV8cWWPmnQ+N2r1gZ3l66X5KAa8QDdHHfIcbzsYyi6/iwdzN/8ww\nk09d1g4GxRVyg2ui0qYzSfCul4iAN4yPGoBAkZmh5mX5v+Ofj6nInf8HMYpfsFQO\n50r9KgHUwr/76zOq5JXP2bd9+hmlLoL6A4fKJARgW2zUYsgWadtjLkdGARw20dgv\nHkVFZI23EHxf21FgODB5UkxzpQhWPhYV6hY/YocdbvZ33eb39qlPNqfG5RoQl66J\n4bcN94gzFNIxOEL+KhWU\n=46Wq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T14:59:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user