7233c8dc84dae53427722807af","node_id":"C_kwDOCwpuNtoAKGY3ODQ2MzE2ODFlMDhjNzIzM2M4ZGM4NGRhZTUzNDI3NzIyODA3YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Workday/canvas-kit/commit/f4ae86b34eec3edc8e580c9384d4919da5ae2a76","sha":"f4ae86b34eec3edc8e580c9384d4919da5ae2a76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/f4ae86b34eec3edc8e580c9384d4919da5ae2a76"}],"sha":"f784631681e08c7233c8dc84dae53427722807af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/f784631681e08c7233c8dc84dae53427722807af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182549198?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olaonikosi","id":182549198,"login":"olaonikosi","node_id":"U_kgDOCuF6zg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olaonikosi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/a15b5e814111c4fcd826067a7fd42e4f144bc067/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T18:45:21Z","email":"onikosi.ola1@gmail.com","name":"olaonikosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T18:45:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mcp): Add version-aware catalog and consumer project detection (#4154)\n\nDetect the consumer project''s installed Canvas packages and scope every MCP catalog answer to them. The MCP index proposes imports; `node_modules` verification disposes — surfacing availability, drift warnings, install commands, and deprecated fallbacks on every response.\n\n- Resolve project context via `projectPath` → MCP roots → `CANVAS_PROJECT_ROOT` → `cwd`\n- Rebuild component/token/icon catalogs from v16.0.8 with installed-tree verification\n- Add `versionContext` envelope to all tool responses\n- New tools: `get-canvas-project-context`, `validate-canvas-code`, `get-canvas-upgrade-path`, plus catalog search/lookup/validation tools\n\n[category:Infrastructure]\n\nRelease Note:\nCanvas Kit MCP now detects the consumer project''s installed `@workday/canvas-*` package versions and verifies catalog recommendations against `node_modules`, including drift warnings and availability blocks for uninstalled packages.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ola Onikosi <michael.onikosi@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: manuel.carrera <manuel.carrera@workday.com>","tree":{"sha":"af8a85b5e6b0150203d61081e050749c647e07a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/trees/af8a85b5e6b0150203d61081e050749c647e07a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/commits/a15b5e814111c4fcd826067a7fd42e4f144bc067","verification":{"payload":"tree af8a85b5e6b0150203d61081e050749c647e07a7\nparent b7c57e4d09770b8ff03b6bbb51f10034fd6448cc\nauthor olaonikosi <onikosi.ola1@gmail.com> 1789411521 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789411521 -0600\n\nfeat(mcp): Add version-aware catalog and consumer project detection (#4154)\n\nDetect the consumer project''s installed Canvas packages and scope every MCP catalog answer to them. The MCP index proposes imports; `node_modules` verification disposes — surfacing availability, drift warnings, install commands, and deprecated fallbacks on every response.\n\n- Resolve project context via `projectPath` → MCP roots → `CANVAS_PROJECT_ROOT` → `cwd`\n- Rebuild component/token/icon catalogs from v16.0.8 with installed-tree verification\n- Add `versionContext` envelope to all tool responses\n- New tools: `get-canvas-project-context`, `validate-canvas-code`, `get-canvas-upgrade-path`, plus catalog search/lookup/validation tools\n\n[category:Infrastructure]\n\nRelease Note:\nCanvas Kit MCP now detects the consumer project''s installed `@workday/canvas-*` package versions and verifies catalog recommendations against `node_modules`, including drift warnings and availability blocks for uninstalled packages.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ola Onikosi <michael.onikosi@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: manuel.carrera <manuel.carrera@workday.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqEDBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqmcQAGS9zMWQOhKO1PSEThWxvw/5\nAgGpTyfIZ9tPVBEJWax/lImmXb/5y8uL7ZT8aDaBomR0RTnUxT8d//HfLVngGVXi\nTRJbzdT2mkgbrt8Ep9PkttBVZUAR7nV6P12YEoXMNkebjv+z1M88OosFdpOaPk0/\npoa8n0vU7SaXuLU3CG/tLE+SEmMXCNtDAef6Y4zy75+GOMv+2Wo5IKJYx82cq1Qd\n6v0xoddH8LaCY1qepXDK8RUCFZ8YmJPVQRmn8k/TwiEXMiCezcSEamlnVzXA6m9M\ndDVfyeKoS6bO6uAHG4WMwI+zgMrjSoM8Dgw0QBe8+Xa0cvaYiN2d+hlOsWnlGAfb\nctif30B/K75WkwkHGVpD3cZ9JPM7h/6bQdHAUm4k6uvitJ2P7r/qD35wS8McZ/i0\nboRLe4B2mRNbc5L9IXiEwU74Wf79iOkLn/aLs3UQzTnkJPWOs7CuYuW39KjFjJfm\nB0ySByXSZ4OjYUyqTbN1fJzjaHinvmxu7e+yhquezGD2b3zrl3Dqpp8r1sv2mYgq\nqbAGqec5WXdrmiHN+Y+oIml514m97UTR02d8r/9gYSJ/ev21onvtKGH0ujn0L15i\nUJbFMzt0Kr9RhLQlcr7/AFiu2rbPfTKrPxDjlhs1z6JyERj85vx+wGhcWKqAQQPb\nBxK2Mtw4WT1VWV7ie4/R\n=ESjm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T18:45:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar