iptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamjstanton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/commits/89eaf6267ad2cf4e981e74e0837874cc7290ace0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:01:57Z","email":"40372497+williamjstanton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"William Stanton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:01:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(StatusIndicator): Stop forcing `role=\"img\"` on StatusIndicator.Icon (#4158)\n\nFixes: #2282 \n\n`StatusIndicator.Icon` no longer sets `role=\"img\"` by default, so decorative icons stay hidden from assistive technology when they sit next to `StatusIndicator.Label`. Preview Status Indicator docs now include Accessibility guidance for that pattern (minimum structure, built-in behaviors, requirements, and anti-patterns), plus an Icon example note and corrected `variant` names.\n\n[category:Components, Documentation]\n\nRelease Note:\n`StatusIndicator.Icon` no longer applies `role=\"img\"` automatically. Decorative icons next to a label need no extra ARIA. If an icon conveys meaning beyond the label, set `role=\"img\"` and a translated `aria-label` on `StatusIndicator.Icon`.\n\nCo-authored-by: William Stanton <william.stanton@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"1da2aeaee30578b40b217ab6bc79d6c0913718f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/trees/1da2aeaee30578b40b217ab6bc79d6c0913718f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/commits/89eaf6267ad2cf4e981e74e0837874cc7290ace0","verification":{"payload":"tree 1da2aeaee30578b40b217ab6bc79d6c0913718f2\nparent 1beac223ba75b47655ae919851bd3766e4c1c51f\nauthor William Stanton <40372497+williamjstanton@users.noreply.github.com> 1788199317 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788199317 -0600\n\nfix(StatusIndicator): Stop forcing `role=\"img\"` on StatusIndicator.Icon (#4158)\n\nFixes: #2282 \n\n`StatusIndicator.Icon` no longer sets `role=\"img\"` by default, so decorative icons stay hidden from assistive technology when they sit next to `StatusIndicator.Label`. Preview Status Indicator docs now include Accessibility guidance for that pattern (minimum structure, built-in behaviors, requirements, and anti-patterns), plus an Icon example note and corrected `variant` names.\n\n[category:Components, Documentation]\n\nRelease Note:\n`StatusIndicator.Icon` no longer applies `role=\"img\"` automatically. Decorative icons next to a label need no extra ARIA. If an icon conveys meaning beyond the label, set `role=\"img\"` and a translated `aria-label` on `StatusIndicator.Icon`.\n\nCo-authored-by: William Stanton <william.stanton@workday.com>\nCo-authored-by: @cursoragent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlcGVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPToQAE+CN6ablrdzf1PI57WThl/i\n0Ab/X/RxFCvEzv0RK6VmNkcAp9SfBQHlnhHfScI+GuGT2/8ihByI6ckXmijEtKid\nqinAYD5nSXFj0HTHqTsa7exWg9H1DCU6IH6P40LU7M21ABeemcpbz+Vb+LIIcxeE\ncPyRdSn0qzTrqnX23YvQFxS7tOJ3Of+qLFWJ0CpFZuyZeKWH7tLAIGLKM6V0UjNd\nO1PZcBGiAa6UURwW7MdUh1H9dJ4r3Xx3WkSxK1oxVyXH6eE5WKamu60uvq0HNfgd\nFQCz6r0bBkANYGLtZ71Jc6YhYR5YMfLF9I7xEs1YAQhW1Wrc0v06REUkdaMRcqDg\nbc4GlLL0hmEKqdIgy/LsZOLOiL55S/ksGwhOC+TXoYeALQ+3bsIR+/cUxa3rFxHW\na5QVTtFlGDf87nuQI0QXqRswE6Rc7nN8rdwtAU6eETgUfKfturrk0lRQ9G4eMn8n\nSUA/uu/vzAAw7SCfvxPgcwjUZxPaT8hlMU0eMWaOQhZMWhOYfpGauKV5nGxumLAa\ncCzctIfR9bzvL984It05k5WKhjnC8qxCEyvz+5wiGmq+cCV/0XNV7w27DTooyjZZ\nt0O8A32k3cVXXvAHt7G/FPP1Bt4FdYnzr14nZd1jWAmPJ2zLa/X6HZYlj06WMJjj\ncUIeFOspQ2XAxReogopn\n=jVpj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T18:01:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu