te will break any visual snapshots as the icon has changed from `extendIcon` to `sidebarLeftIcon`. It is safe to accept these visual changes. The icon also no longer flips on expand / collapse, but it will still respect end (right) origin and RTL.","tree":{"sha":"ecbcecb65cf794c87e912c2e7188a8f21430b000","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/trees/ecbcecb65cf794c87e912c2e7188a8f21430b000"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Workday/canvas-kit/git/commits/a96fd895cb99026c950b162b730f84378e7974c2","verification":{"payload":"tree ecbcecb65cf794c87e912c2e7188a8f21430b000\nparent 23b7a01723b0057b59410a2c3b3bd279d3f6b3aa\nauthor Alan B Smith <a.bax.smith@gmail.com> 1785957617 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785957617 -0600\n\nfix: Update SidePanel to use sidebarLeft icon (#4071)\n\nFixes: #4069\n\n- Bump canvas-system-icons-web to v4.2.0 (we didn''t need to do this, but I went ahead with it to keep us current).\n- Update SidePanel to use `sidebarLeftIcon`\n\nThe SidePanel component doesn''t match our latest v15 Figma, so we''re updating it.\n\n[category:Components]\n\nRelease Note:\nThis update will break any visual snapshots as the icon has changed from `extendIcon` to `sidebarLeftIcon`. It is safe to accept these visual changes. The icon also no longer flips on expand / collapse, but it will still respect end (right) origin and RTL.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqc4zxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAb5EQAGsqJOrkoi/kjYQYAdHnDuxT\nXQ3V17lxW/3pIJuHVriGAeJI6em14vPz/Kv2RN4y+WLEWWK6v3SsIsPB1SIJO6Bo\ndXgQlIs57Z9DP1RsJLfoQtGRS6Et5h7cRbWRN5E9OBQQ0e20cQY5q+az1LUiUx5d\nbq8X8tEbWgG6x3HIzNKa6yvuXaPK1tCVvNOMONLFH6y/JsDd/ra5CU2olhmHrvW6\nJmvZ3D06+muiJp3ManlZFtblvWpYYCuPG1Bs0Khf6Qg5wbMwt2wkBGyfH96evb1G\nQKkx6C/wvMTGmi770qP/dP0OpcPd5sn9ya6vSLu3yYO8wYULXhWiwCPwKpQDxhbz\nyCkI+xITtERKFZX1bHskI+bkEKtDYesJRs4lsWPqg1IH1w5uJmXPZYfNmvXb+xDU\ntVZge6cz3M2RDu+Rkxo3Cg/JeidTbA0dj4O8j/2c6yAUH4AMkn+VEEDUV1P64Nod\nWUsX8A9v/wtNqKSBigNdv