ing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duckki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/duckki","id":3218836,"login":"duckki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTg4MzY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duckki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duckki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duckki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duckki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duckki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/duckki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/commits/ecc0c70da845f23fc9170754f13f2cddb82857b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T18:45:53Z","email":"duckki.oe@apollographql.com","name":"Duckki Oe"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T18:45:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade to graphql-java 25.0 and Spring Boot 4 (#449)\n\nThis PR upgrades the project to graphql-java to 25.0 and Spring Boot\n4.0.2 and updates all dependencies to their latest compatible stable\nversions.\n\n### Major Version Updates\n- **Spring Boot**: 3.3.6 → 4.0.2\n- **Spring GraphQL**: 1.3.3 → 2.0.2\n- **graphql-java**: 22.3 → 25.0\n\n### Additional Dependency Updates\n- **JetBrains Annotations**: 24.1.0 → 26.0.1\n- **JUnit**: 5.10.5 → 5.11.4\n- **Reactor**: 3.6.12 → 3.7.4\n- **Nexus Publish Plugin**: Removed\n\n### Breaking Tests Fixed\n- Updated test schema snapshots for graphql-java 25 SDL output format\nchanges\n- Updated package imports for Spring Boot 4\n(`GraphQlSourceBuilderCustomizer`, `ObjectMapper`)\n- Fixed Jackson 3.x namespace change (`com.fasterxml` → `tools.jackson`)\n- ~Resolved Spring Boot 4 test infrastructure changes (removed\nauto-wired `WebTestClient`, created local factory methods)~\n- Fixed subscription callback tests to use `verifier`, not callback URL.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dariusz Kuc <9501705+dariuszkuc@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"506fdad8cb57eadb9a9ddb4d91e506495e52c992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/git/trees/506fdad8cb57eadb9a9ddb4d91e506495e52c992"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/git/commits/ecc0c70da845f23fc9170754f13f2cddb82857b8","verification":{"payload":"tree 506fdad8cb57eadb9a9ddb4d91e506495e52c992\nparent f7013646f4e0adccb6fd694bc237ae997c86c584\nauthor Duckki Oe <duckki.oe@apollographql.com> 1770144353 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770144353 -0800\n\nUpgrade to graphql-java 25.0 and Spring Boot 4 (#449)\n\nThis PR upgrades the project to graphql-java to 25.0 and Spring Boot\n4.0.2 and updates all dependencies to their latest compatible stable\nversions.\n\n### Major Version Updates\n- **Spring Boot**: 3.3.6 → 4.0.2\n- **Spring GraphQL**: 1.3.3 → 2.0.2\n- **graphql-java**: 22.3 → 25.0\n\n### Additional Dependency Updates\n- **JetBrains Annotations**: 24.1.0 → 26.0.1\n- **JUnit**: 5.10.5 → 5.11.4\n- **Reactor**: 3.6.12 → 3.7.4\n- **Nexus Publish Plugin**: Removed\n\n### Breaking Tests Fixed\n- Updated test schema snapshots for graphql-java 25 SDL output format\nchanges\n- Updated package imports for Spring Boot 4\n(`GraphQlSourceBuilderCustomizer`, `ObjectMapper`)\n- Fixed Jackson 3.x namespace change (`com.fasterxml` → `tools.jackson`)\n- ~Resolved Spring Boot 4 test infrastructure changes (removed\nauto-wired `WebTestClient`, created local factory methods)~\n- Fixed subscription callback tests to use `verifier`, not callback URL.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dariusz Kuc <9501705+dariuszkuc@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpgkJhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmvIQAAf0OqhGaBvi46M1HqKTXaiE\naYFfFGCFiIigd0vFdDcXh0vUDsCWhIupHsXt+BlxjLHMPlq95acwuZW1eriE84qx\n/PRifvQ87OfSu3JZzAlTq+PeVhKuE2BTgcCLgM7A27goB3Swpd4zsL6GhnBhAKVy\n3xkMCHEqUhn