-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/apollographql/federation-jvm/commit/f7013646f4e0adccb6fd694bc237ae997c86c584","node_id":"C_kwDOCwrlOtoAKGY3MDEzNjQ2ZjRlMGFkY2NiNmZkNjk0YmMyMzdhZTk5N2M4NmM1ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/apollographql/federation-jvm/commit/051937e97916745a2fc278268313b065c594ea4a","sha":"051937e97916745a2fc278268313b065c594ea4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/commits/051937e97916745a2fc278268313b065c594ea4a"}],"sha":"f7013646f4e0adccb6fd694bc237ae997c86c584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/commits/f7013646f4e0adccb6fd694bc237ae997c86c584"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167302364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/foenye","id":167302364,"login":"foenye","node_id":"U_kgDOCfjU3A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foenye","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/commits/051937e97916745a2fc278268313b065c594ea4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-19T16:04:46Z","email":"167302364+foenye@users.noreply.github.com","name":"foenye"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-19T16:04:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Support custom field sorter generated by ServiceSDLPrinter service SDL (#445)\n\nUpdate `SchemaTransformer` to allow setting custom `GraphqlTypeComparatorRegistry` that will be used to generate `_service { sdl }` value. In order to use custom comparator for the transform, update `RuntimeWiring` with appropriate comparator.\n\n```java\n@Bean\nRuntimeWiringConfigurer runtimeWiringConfigurer( ) {\n  return wiringBuilder -> wiringBuilder\n    // custom comparator\n    .comparatorRegistry(DefaultGraphqlTypeComparatorRegistry.AS_IS_REGISTRY);\n}\n```\n\nCloses #444\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: fong <isfong@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: foenye <foenye@qq.com>","tree":{"sha":"0bc890460d1e8cc91753d0e1e3180db41c6ca20e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/git/trees/0bc890460d1e8cc91753d0e1e3180db41c6ca20e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apollographql/federation-jvm/git/commits/051937e97916745a2fc278268313b065c594ea4a","verification":{"payload":"tree 0bc890460d1e8cc91753d0e1e3180db41c6ca20e\nparent 450b426ad1e030c5c0ce41cb72b9c02e3ee1f686\nauthor foenye <167302364+foenye@users.noreply.github.com> 1766160286 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1766160286 -0600\n\nfeat: Support custom field sorter generated by ServiceSDLPrinter service SDL (#445)\n\nUpdate `SchemaTransformer` to allow setting custom `GraphqlTypeComparatorRegistry` that will be used to generate `_service { sdl }` value. In order to use custom comparator for the transform, update `RuntimeWiring` with appropriate comparator.\n\n```java\n@Bean\nRuntimeWiringConfigurer runtimeWiringConfigurer( ) {\n  return wiringBuilder -> wiringBuilder\n    // custom comparator\n    .comparatorRegistry(DefaultGraphqlTypeComparatorRegistry.AS_IS_REGISTRY);\n}\n```\n\nCloses #444\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: fong <isfong@qq.com>\nSigned-off-by: foenye <foenye@qq.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpRXeeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2goQAC1a4zxplH9K0dxYFnF2EZbm\npKb+uuUk+eyMKuZsYJnsD3wT7bCEWmntkVoQ+YeGHb2UnfLutlHxxJEiv/xQ+U9B\nrXLmVWSG0xGBIeYUbrWkZisG5X9AMYMQlOpuHfud/dWmIgUGl0GstO0h4eglQ1oQ\nMTUNW6LIoK1QxoLUc1LNRUjLdywrD+RFJ0+zRU7WA4J3UGahsIjL0hgpuDyG1clO\njFcq9R05zGZa/Bu40JB/SNOFVetntRvc0jpJmwjlFLaci+sAnm6xsF4xE/XP1Qym\ncAx7Ak6UWnwaUgx3VOc++zII6ivIR1rF85QK+2E1HgOjX/Q0SjWqeEy+oe3W1Oc5\nG2p1T9hPP2jIIa8sJ+HpuqWUeB6uCHG41bLRCa49MqQw+lYw0mNAk1IcY5HkOKrS\n0jIhJG1mqEVu0yaUWOEV9B9wsNmuwlark3ibRsZkO6Zhw6ooQPU2gLtlp5I7XCEP\nhjlSTtTR22UifIquTG+1NbMl4CdXqFa5PsbP63nMEtqmzy35Lsehf6/oXVpFWN7L\n6WvRyfQWNSMWgSMpL9o6QvaYUl+Y9/wRLU4fXfqpjeU/FwHNhtTyxu/BwjsTBnjh\nV12saljUO05AK3/Z8wJjBBgFQXH2ERoyH8lsWUgFuZDSevcB31QxJQ+hGRZRKYlQ\npXMmNmlan3mLeZVdQV03\n=4Tlh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-19T16:04:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr